window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a447-884500da1e2bedd9.json"]={sha256:"884500da1e2bedd9b168882df5dda4793d34f6c9424e2afe62d6fe4d964e7972",value:{"id":"a447","title":"X 光光電子能譜儀","titleEn":"X-ray photoelectron spectrometers","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從光電效應的能量守恆與電子的非彈性平均自由徑出發，理解 XPS 為何只看最表面 10 nm 並能分辨化學態，再把 Al Kα 單色器、半球型能量分析器、能量尺度校正、定量與偵測極限、超高真空與深度剖析整合成可驗收的表面分析儀器工程。","summaryEn":"Start from photoelectric energy conservation and the electron inelastic mean free path to see why XPS probes only the top 10 nm yet resolves chemical states, then integrate the Al Kα monochromator, hemispherical energy analyser, energy-scale calibration, quantification and detection limits, ultrahigh vacuum and depth profiling into an acceptable surface-analysis instrument record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-analytical-instruments","subcategoryTitle":"電子、離子與分析儀器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Electron, ion and analytical instruments","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-analytical-instruments","learningTags":["optics","optics-analytical-instruments","spectrometer"],"architectureFamily":"spectrometer","architectureNodes":[["Al 陽極與石英單色器","Al anode and quartz monochromator"],["樣品台與電荷中和槍","Sample stage and charge neutraliser"],["傳輸透鏡","Transfer lens"],["半球型分析器","Hemispherical analyser"],["多通道偵測器","Multichannel detector"],["UHV 腔與離子槍","UHV chamber and ion gun"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[5,1]],"diagram":{"type":"spectrometer","labels":["Al 陽極與石英單色器","樣品台與電荷中和槍","傳輸透鏡","半球型分析器","多通道偵測器"],"labelsEn":["Al anode and quartz monochromator","Sample stage and charge neutraliser","Transfer lens","Hemispherical analyser","Multichannel detector"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"氧化層厚度與定量練習：在 θ = 0° 量得矽晶圓的 Si 2p 氧化峰與元素峰面積比 I_ox/I_Si = 0.50，取 λ_ox = 3.4 nm、R₀ = 0.9，厚度 d = 3.4×ln(1 + 0.50/0.9) = 3.4×0.442 ≈ 1.5 nm。把樣品轉到 θ = 45°（cosθ = 0.707），模型預測比值為 0.9×(exp(1.5/(3.4×0.707)) − 1) = 0.9×(exp(0.624) − 1) ≈ 0.78；若實測為 0.76，兩角度反推的厚度分別為 1.50 nm 與 1.47 nm，一致性在 ±0.1 nm 內，支持均勻薄膜假設。再以 Scofield 截面定量同一表面：O 1s 面積 12 000 ÷ 2.93 = 4 096，Si 2p 面積 2 000 ÷ 0.82 = 2 439，經 λ ∝ E_k^0.75 修正後 O/Si ≈ 2.2，與 1.5 nm 的 SiO₂ 加上部分基材 Si 的訊號相符。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Oxide-thickness and quantification exercise: at θ = 0° the Si 2p oxide-to-element area ratio on a silicon wafer is I_ox/I_Si = 0.50; with λ_ox = 3.4 nm and R₀ = 0.9 the thickness is d = 3.4×ln(1 + 0.50/0.9) = 3.4×0.442 ≈ 1.5 nm. Tilting to θ = 45° (cosθ = 0.707) the model predicts a ratio of 0.9×(exp(1.5/(3.4×0.707)) − 1) = 0.9×(exp(0.624) − 1) ≈ 0.78; if 0.76 is measured, the two angles return 1.50 nm and 1.47 nm, consistent within ±0.1 nm and supporting the uniform-film assumption. Quantifying the same surface with Scofield cross-sections: O 1s area 12 000 ÷ 2.93 = 4 096 and Si 2p area 2 000 ÷ 0.82 = 2 439, and after the λ ∝ E_k^0.75 correction O/Si ≈ 2.2, consistent with 1.5 nm of SiO₂ plus some substrate Si signal. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a447-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「光電效應、結合能與化學位移」與「表面靈敏度與資訊深度」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift\" and \"Surface sensitivity and information depth\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a447-v12-01","title":"光電效應、結合能與化學位移：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「光電子動能與結合能」如何決定X 光光電子能譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Photoelectron kinetic and binding energy” determines the key performance of “X-ray photoelectron spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"單色 X 光打在樣品上，把內層電子激發出來；量到的光電子動能 E_k 與結合能 E_b 由能量守恆連結：E_b = hν − E_k − φ，其中 φ 是分析器的功函數，因為樣品與分析器電性連接時以共同的費米能階為能量零點。每個元素的內層能階是指紋，而同一元素在不同化學環境下結合能會移動零點幾到數 eV，氧化態越高位移越正，這就是 XPS 能分辨 Si 與 SiO₂、C–C 與 C=O 的根據。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光電子動能與結合能」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Monochromatic X-rays eject core electrons from the sample; the measured kinetic energy E_k and the binding energy E_b are linked by energy conservation, E_b = hν − E_k − φ, where φ is the analyser work function because a sample in electrical contact with the analyser shares its Fermi level as the energy zero. Each element's core levels are a fingerprint, and the same element shifts by a few tenths to several electronvolts in different chemical environments, more positive for higher oxidation states, which is how XPS separates Si from SiO₂ or C–C from C=O. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Photoelectron kinetic and binding energy”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Al Kα 光子能量 hν = 1486.6 eV，分析器功函數取 φ = 4.5 eV。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With Al Kα photons hν = 1486.6 eV and an analyser work function φ = 4.5 eV, elemental Si 2p at E_b = 99.4 eV gives photoelectrons of E_k = 1486.6 − 99.4 − 4.5 = 1382.7 eV; in SiO₂ the Si 2p shifts to 103.4 eV and the kinetic energy drops to 1378.7 eV, a 4.0 eV difference.","failure":"常見誤解：「結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光電子動能與結合能」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Photoelectron kinetic and binding energy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-01-k1","title":"光電效應、結合能與化學位移","titleEn":"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift","text":"單色 X 光打在樣品上，把內層電子激發出來；量到的光電子動能 E_k 與結合能 E_b 由能量守恆連結：E_b = hν − E_k − φ，其中 φ 是分析器的功函數，因為樣品與分析器電性連接時以共同的費米能階為能量零點。每個元素的內層能階是指紋，而同一元素在不同化學環境下結合能會移動零點幾到數 eV，氧化態越高位移越正，這就是 XPS 能分辨 Si 與 SiO₂、C–C 與 C=O 的根據。","textEn":"Monochromatic X-rays eject core electrons from the sample; the measured kinetic energy E_k and the binding energy E_b are linked by energy conservation, E_b = hν − E_k − φ, where φ is the analyser work function because a sample in electrical contact with the analyser shares its Fermi level as the energy zero. Each element's core levels are a fingerprint, and the same element shifts by a few tenths to several electronvolts in different chemical environments, more positive for higher oxidation states, which is how XPS separates Si from SiO₂ or C–C from C=O.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光電效應、結合能與化學位移」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift\" is correct?","options":["結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。","單色 X 光打在樣品上，把內層電子激發出來。","X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。"],"optionsEn":["Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment.","Monochromatic X-rays eject core electrons from the sample.","X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres."],"answer":1,"explanation":"單色 X 光打在樣品上，把內層電子激發出來；量到的光電子動能 E_k 與結合能 E_b 由能量守恆連結：E_b = hν − E_k − φ，其中 φ 是分析器的功函數，因為樣品與分析器電性連接時以共同的費米能階為能量零點。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Monochromatic X-rays eject core electrons from the sample; the measured kinetic energy E_k and the binding energy E_b are linked by energy conservation, E_b = hν − E_k − φ, where φ is the analyser work function because a sample in electrical contact with the analyser shares its Fermi level as the energy zero. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a447-v12-02","title":"光電效應、結合能與化學位移：定量估算","titleEn":"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光電子動能與結合能」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Photoelectron kinetic and binding energy” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Al Kα 光子能量 hν = 1486.6 eV，分析器功函數取 φ = 4.5 eV。元素 Si 2p 的 E_b = 99.4 eV，光電子動能 E_k = 1486.6 − 99.4 − 4.5 = 1382.7 eV；SiO₂ 中 Si 2p 位移到 103.4 eV，動能降為 1378.7 eV，差 4.0 eV。C 1s 參考峰 284.8 eV 對應 E_k = 1197.3 eV；若改用 Mg Kα（1253.6 eV），同一 Si 2p 的動能變為 1149.7 eV，但結合能不變，這是辨認歐傑峰（動能固定）與光電子峰（結合能固定）的方法。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With Al Kα photons hν = 1486.6 eV and an analyser work function φ = 4.5 eV, elemental Si 2p at E_b = 99.4 eV gives photoelectrons of E_k = 1486.6 − 99.4 − 4.5 = 1382.7 eV; in SiO₂ the Si 2p shifts to 103.4 eV and the kinetic energy drops to 1378.7 eV, a 4.0 eV difference. The C 1s reference at 284.8 eV corresponds to E_k = 1197.3 eV; switching to Mg Kα (1253.6 eV) moves the same Si 2p to 1149.7 eV while its binding energy is unchanged, which is how Auger peaks (fixed kinetic energy) are told from photoelectron peaks (fixed binding energy). Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在濺射清潔的 Si 晶圓上取 Si 2p 高解析譜，確認元素峰在 99.4 eV 附近、2p₃/₂ 與 2p₁/₂ 自旋軌道分裂 0.6 eV；再量帶自然氧化層的晶圓，確認 103 到 104 eV 的氧化峰；最後用兩種陽極或與 NIST XPS 資料庫比對，確認歐傑峰隨光子能量移動而光電子峰不動。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Take a high-resolution Si 2p spectrum on a sputter-cleaned Si wafer, confirming the elemental peak near 99.4 eV with a 0.6 eV spin-orbit splitting between 2p₃/₂ and 2p₁/₂; then measure a wafer with native oxide and confirm the oxide component at 103 to 104 eV; finally use two anodes or the NIST XPS database to check that Auger peaks move with photon energy while photoelectron peaks do not.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Al Kα 光子能量 hν = 1486.6 eV，分析器功函數取 φ = 4.5 eV。元素 Si 2p 的 E_b = 99.4 eV，光電子動能 E_k = 1486.6 − 99.4 − 4.5 = 1382.7 eV；SiO₂ 中 Si 2p 位移到 103.4 eV，動能降為 1378.7 eV，差 4.0 eV。C 1s 參考峰 284.8 eV 對應 E_k = 1197.3 eV；若改用 Mg Kα（1253.6 eV），同一 Si 2p 的動能變為 1149.7 eV，但結合能不變，這是辨認歐傑峰（動能固定）與光電子峰（結合能固定）的方法。","textEn":"With Al Kα photons hν = 1486.6 eV and an analyser work function φ = 4.5 eV, elemental Si 2p at E_b = 99.4 eV gives photoelectrons of E_k = 1486.6 − 99.4 − 4.5 = 1382.7 eV; in SiO₂ the Si 2p shifts to 103.4 eV and the kinetic energy drops to 1378.7 eV, a 4.0 eV difference. The C 1s reference at 284.8 eV corresponds to E_k = 1197.3 eV; switching to Mg Kα (1253.6 eV) moves the same Si 2p to 1149.7 eV while its binding energy is unchanged, which is how Auger peaks (fixed kinetic energy) are told from photoelectron peaks (fixed binding energy).","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光電效應、結合能與化學位移」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift\", which statement holds?","options":["通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。","譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。","Al Kα 光子能量 hν = 1486.6 eV，分析器功函數取 φ = 4.5 eV。"],"optionsEn":["Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate.","The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio.","With Al Kα photons hν = 1486.6 eV and an analyser work function φ = 4.5 eV, elemental Si 2p at E_b = 99.4 eV gives photoelectrons of E_k = 1486.6 − 99.4 − 4.5 = 1382.7 eV."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Al Kα 光子能量 hν = 1486.6 eV，分析器功函數取 φ = 4.5 eV。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With Al Kα photons hν = 1486.6 eV and an analyser work function φ = 4.5 eV, elemental Si 2p at E_b = 99.4 eV gives photoelectrons of E_k = 1486.6 − 99.4 − 4.5 = 1382.7 eV; in SiO₂ the Si 2p shifts to 103.4 eV and the kinetic energy drops to 1378.7 eV, a 4.0 eV difference. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a447-v12-03","title":"光電效應、結合能與化學位移：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光電子動能與結合能」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Photoelectron kinetic and binding energy” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在濺射清潔的 Si 晶圓上取 Si 2p 高解析譜，確認元素峰在 99.4 eV 附近、2p₃/₂ 與 2p₁/₂ 自旋軌道分裂 0.6 eV；再量帶自然氧化層的晶圓，確認 103 到 104 eV 的氧化峰；最後用兩種陽極或與 NIST XPS 資料庫比對，確認歐傑峰隨光子能量移動而光電子峰不動。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Take a high-resolution Si 2p spectrum on a sputter-cleaned Si wafer, confirming the elemental peak near 99.4 eV with a 0.6 eV spin-orbit splitting between 2p₃/₂ and 2p₁/₂; then measure a wafer with native oxide and confirm the oxide component at 103 to 104 eV; finally use two anodes or the NIST XPS database to check that Auger peaks move with photon energy while photoelectron peaks do not. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把譜圖中的歐傑峰（如 O KLL 在 Al Kα 下落在約 978 eV 結合能處）誤認為某元素的光電子峰，會報告根本不存在的元素；或者把樣品接觸不良造成的整體位移解釋成化學態變化。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Mistaking an Auger peak, such as O KLL appearing near 978 eV on the binding-energy scale under Al Kα, for a photoelectron peak reports an element that is not there; likewise a rigid shift caused by poor sample contact can be misread as a chemical-state change.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在濺射清潔的 Si 晶圓上取 Si 2p 高解析譜，確認元素峰在 99.4 eV 附近、2p₃/₂ 與 2p₁/₂ 自旋軌道分裂 0.6 eV；再量帶自然氧化層的晶圓，確認 103 到 104 eV 的氧化峰；最後用兩種陽極或與 NIST XPS 資料庫比對，確認歐傑峰隨光子能量移動而光電子峰不動。","textEn":"Take a high-resolution Si 2p spectrum on a sputter-cleaned Si wafer, confirming the elemental peak near 99.4 eV with a 0.6 eV spin-orbit splitting between 2p₃/₂ and 2p₁/₂; then measure a wafer with native oxide and confirm the oxide component at 103 to 104 eV; finally use two anodes or the NIST XPS database to check that Auger peaks move with photon energy while photoelectron peaks do not.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光電效應、結合能與化學位移」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift\"?","options":["在濺射清潔的 Si 晶圓上取 Si 2p 高解析譜，確認元素峰在 99.4 eV 附近、2p₃/₂ 與 2p₁/₂ 自旋軌道分裂 0.6 eV。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Take a high-resolution Si 2p spectrum on a sputter-cleaned Si wafer, confirming the elemental peak near 99.4 eV with a 0.6 eV spin-orbit splitting between 2p₃/₂ and 2p₁/₂.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在濺射清潔的 Si 晶圓上取 Si 2p 高解析譜，確認元素峰在 99.4 eV 附近、2p₃/₂ 與 2p₁/₂ 自旋軌道分裂 0.6 eV；再量帶自然氧化層的晶圓，確認 103 到 104 eV 的氧化峰；最後用兩種陽極或與 NIST XPS 資料庫比對，確認歐傑峰隨光子能量移動而光電子峰不動。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Take a high-resolution Si 2p spectrum on a sputter-cleaned Si wafer, confirming the elemental peak near 99.4 eV with a 0.6 eV spin-orbit splitting between 2p₃/₂ and 2p₁/₂; then measure a wafer with native oxide and confirm the oxide component at 103 to 104 eV; finally use two anodes or the NIST XPS database to check that Auger peaks move with photon energy while photoelectron peaks do not. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a447-v12-04","title":"光電效應、結合能與化學位移：失效診斷","titleEn":"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光電子動能與結合能」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Photoelectron kinetic and binding energy” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把譜圖中的歐傑峰（如 O KLL 在 Al Kα 下落在約 978 eV 結合能處）誤認為某元素的光電子峰，會報告根本不存在的元素；或者把樣品接觸不良造成的整體位移解釋成化學態變化。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Mistaking an Auger peak, such as O KLL appearing near 978 eV on the binding-energy scale under Al Kα, for a photoelectron peak reports an element that is not there; likewise a rigid shift caused by poor sample contact can be misread as a chemical-state change. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：每個元素的內層能階是指紋，而同一元素在不同化學環境下結合能會移動零點幾到數 eV，氧化態越高位移越正，這就是 XPS 能分辨 Si 與 SiO₂、C–C 與 C=O 的根據。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Each element's core levels are a fingerprint, and the same element shifts by a few tenths to several electronvolts in different chemical environments, more positive for higher oxidation states, which is how XPS separates Si from SiO₂ or C–C from C=O.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把譜圖中的歐傑峰（如 O KLL 在 Al Kα 下落在約 978 eV 結合能處）誤認為某元素的光電子峰，會報告根本不存在的元素；或者把樣品接觸不良造成的整體位移解釋成化學態變化。","textEn":"Mistaking an Auger peak, such as O KLL appearing near 978 eV on the binding-energy scale under Al Kα, for a photoelectron peak reports an element that is not there; likewise a rigid shift caused by poor sample contact can be misread as a chemical-state change.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光電效應、結合能與化學位移」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Photoelectric effect, binding energy and chemical shift\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","把譜圖中的歐傑峰（如 O KLL 在 Al Kα 下落在約 978 eV 結合能處）誤認為某元素的光電子峰，會報告根本不存在的元素。","X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Mistaking an Auger peak, such as O KLL appearing near 978 eV on the binding-energy scale under Al Kα, for a photoelectron peak reports an element that is not there.","X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把譜圖中的歐傑峰（如 O KLL 在 Al Kα 下落在約 978 eV 結合能處）誤認為某元素的光電子峰，會報告根本不存在的元素；或者把樣品接觸不良造成的整體位移解釋成化學態變化。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Mistaking an Auger peak, such as O KLL appearing near 978 eV on the binding-energy scale under Al Kα, for a photoelectron peak reports an element that is not there; likewise a rigid shift caused by poor sample contact can be misread as a chemical-state change. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a447-v12-05","title":"表面靈敏度與資訊深度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Surface sensitivity and information depth: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「非彈性平均自由徑 λ」如何決定X 光光電子能譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Inelastic mean free path λ” determines the key performance of “X-ray photoelectron spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"X 光可穿入樣品數微米，但只有沒有損失能量就逃出表面的光電子才形成特徵峰；電子在固體中發生非彈性散射前平均走的距離稱為非彈性平均自由徑 λ，在 1 keV 附近多數材料為 1 到 4 nm。來自深度 z 的訊號以 exp(−z/(λ·cosθ)) 衰減，θ 是出射角相對表面法線，95% 的訊號來自 3λ·cosθ 以內。因此 XPS 的資訊深度約 10 nm，傾斜樣品可以把它縮到幾 nm，這是角解析 XPS 量超薄膜厚度的基礎。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「非彈性平均自由徑 λ」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"X-rays penetrate micrometres into a sample, but only photoelectrons that escape without losing energy form the characteristic peaks; the mean distance an electron travels before an inelastic event is the inelastic mean free path λ, between 1 and 4 nm for most materials near 1 keV. Signal from depth z is attenuated as exp(−z/(λ·cosθ)), with θ the emission angle from the surface normal, and 95% of the signal comes from within 3λ·cosθ. The information depth is therefore about 10 nm, and tilting the sample shrinks it to a few nanometres, the basis of angle-resolved XPS thickness measurement of ultrathin films. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Inelastic mean free path λ”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：取 Si 2p 在 SiO₂ 中的 λ_ox = 3.4 nm（TPP-2M 估計，Al Kα）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Take λ_ox = 3.4 nm for Si 2p in SiO₂ (TPP-2M estimate, Al Kα).","failure":"常見誤解：「X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「非彈性平均自由徑 λ」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Inelastic mean free path λ”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-05-k1","title":"表面靈敏度與資訊深度","titleEn":"Surface sensitivity and information depth","text":"X 光可穿入樣品數微米，但只有沒有損失能量就逃出表面的光電子才形成特徵峰；電子在固體中發生非彈性散射前平均走的距離稱為非彈性平均自由徑 λ，在 1 keV 附近多數材料為 1 到 4 nm。來自深度 z 的訊號以 exp(−z/(λ·cosθ)) 衰減，θ 是出射角相對表面法線，95% 的訊號來自 3λ·cosθ 以內。","textEn":"X-rays penetrate micrometres into a sample, but only photoelectrons that escape without losing energy form the characteristic peaks; the mean distance an electron travels before an inelastic event is the inelastic mean free path λ, between 1 and 4 nm for most materials near 1 keV. Signal from depth z is attenuated as exp(−z/(λ·cosθ)), with θ the emission angle from the surface normal, and 95% of the signal comes from within 3λ·cosθ.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「表面靈敏度與資訊深度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Surface sensitivity and information depth\" is correct?","options":["X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。","單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。","X 光可穿入樣品數微米，但只有沒有損失能量就逃出表面的光電子才形成特徵峰。"],"optionsEn":["X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres.","A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution.","X-rays penetrate micrometres into a sample, but only photoelectrons that escape without losing energy form the characteristic peaks."],"answer":2,"explanation":"X 光可穿入樣品數微米，但只有沒有損失能量就逃出表面的光電子才形成特徵峰；電子在固體中發生非彈性散射前平均走的距離稱為非彈性平均自由徑 λ，在 1 keV 附近多數材料為 1 到 4 nm。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"X-rays penetrate micrometres into a sample, but only photoelectrons that escape without losing energy form the characteristic peaks; the mean distance an electron travels before an inelastic event is the inelastic mean free path λ, between 1 and 4 nm for most materials near 1 keV. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a447-v12-06","title":"表面靈敏度與資訊深度：定量估算","titleEn":"Surface sensitivity and information depth: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「非彈性平均自由徑 λ」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Inelastic mean free path λ” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：取 Si 2p 在 SiO₂ 中的 λ_ox = 3.4 nm（TPP-2M 估計，Al Kα）。資訊深度 3λ·cosθ：θ = 0° 時 10.2 nm，θ = 60° 時 5.1 nm。氧化層厚度由強度比求得：d = λ_ox·cosθ·ln(1 + (I_ox/I_Si)/R₀)，R₀ ≈ 0.9 為厚氧化層與純 Si 的強度比。量得 I_ox/I_Si = 0.5、θ = 0°：d = 3.4×ln(1 + 0.556) = 3.4×0.442 ≈ 1.5 nm；同一樣品轉到 θ = 45° 時模型預測比值升到 0.9×(exp(1.5/2.40) − 1) ≈ 0.78。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Take λ_ox = 3.4 nm for Si 2p in SiO₂ (TPP-2M estimate, Al Kα). The information depth 3λ·cosθ is 10.2 nm at θ = 0° and 5.1 nm at θ = 60°. Oxide thickness follows from the intensity ratio d = λ_ox·cosθ·ln(1 + (I_ox/I_Si)/R₀), with R₀ ≈ 0.9 the ratio for thick oxide against clean Si. For a measured I_ox/I_Si = 0.5 at θ = 0°: d = 3.4×ln(1 + 0.556) = 3.4×0.442 ≈ 1.5 nm; tilting the same sample to θ = 45° should raise the ratio to 0.9×(exp(1.5/2.40) − 1) ≈ 0.78. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在 0°、45°、60° 三個出射角量同一片自然氧化矽的 Si 2p 比值，以上式分別算厚度，三者應一致在 ±0.2 nm 內；再用橢偏儀或 TEM 截面量同一片，比較絕對值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the Si 2p ratio of one native-oxide wafer at emission angles of 0°, 45° and 60°, compute the thickness from each with the formula and require agreement within ±0.2 nm; then compare the absolute value with ellipsometry or a TEM cross-section of the same wafer.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"取 Si 2p 在 SiO₂ 中的 λ_ox = 3.4 nm（TPP-2M 估計，Al Kα）。資訊深度 3λ·cosθ：θ = 0° 時 10.2 nm，θ = 60° 時 5.1 nm。氧化層厚度由強度比求得：d = λ_ox·cosθ·ln(1 + (I_ox/I_Si)/R₀)，R₀ ≈ 0.9 為厚氧化層與純 Si 的強度比。量得 I_ox/I_Si = 0.5、θ = 0°：d = 3.4×ln(1 + 0.556) = 3.4×0.442 ≈ 1.5 nm；同一樣品轉到 θ = 45° 時模型預測比值升到 0.9×(exp(1.5/2.40) − 1) ≈ 0.78。","textEn":"Take λ_ox = 3.4 nm for Si 2p in SiO₂ (TPP-2M estimate, Al Kα). The information depth 3λ·cosθ is 10.2 nm at θ = 0° and 5.1 nm at θ = 60°. Oxide thickness follows from the intensity ratio d = λ_ox·cosθ·ln(1 + (I_ox/I_Si)/R₀), with R₀ ≈ 0.9 the ratio for thick oxide against clean Si. For a measured I_ox/I_Si = 0.5 at θ = 0°: d = 3.4×ln(1 + 0.556) = 3.4×0.442 ≈ 1.5 nm; tilting the same sample to θ = 45° should raise the ratio to 0.9×(exp(1.5/2.40) − 1) ≈ 0.78.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「表面靈敏度與資訊深度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Surface sensitivity and information depth\", which statement holds?","options":["取 Si 2p 在 SiO₂ 中的 λ_ox = 3.4 nm（TPP-2M 估計，Al Kα）。","只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。","真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Take λ_ox = 3.4 nm for Si 2p in SiO₂ (TPP-2M estimate, Al Kα).","Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample.","Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"取 Si 2p 在 SiO₂ 中的 λ_ox = 3.4 nm（TPP-2M 估計，Al Kα）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Take λ_ox = 3.4 nm for Si 2p in SiO₂ (TPP-2M estimate, Al Kα). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a447-v12-07","title":"表面靈敏度與資訊深度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Surface sensitivity and information depth: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「非彈性平均自由徑 λ」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Inelastic mean free path λ” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在 0°、45°、60° 三個出射角量同一片自然氧化矽的 Si 2p 比值，以上式分別算厚度，三者應一致在 ±0.2 nm 內；再用橢偏儀或 TEM 截面量同一片，比較絕對值。λ 值以 NIST SRD 71 資料庫或 TPP-2M 公式取得並記錄所用參數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the Si 2p ratio of one native-oxide wafer at emission angles of 0°, 45° and 60°, compute the thickness from each with the formula and require agreement within ±0.2 nm; then compare the absolute value with ellipsometry or a TEM cross-section of the same wafer. Obtain λ from the NIST SRD 71 database or the TPP-2M formula and record the parameters used. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：表面 1 nm 的碳污染會把下層訊號衰減約 25%，若不校正，定量把污染當成樣品成分，膜厚被高估；粗糙表面讓有效出射角分佈變寬，角解析厚度在高角度處系統性偏離。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A 1 nm carbon contamination layer attenuates the underlying signal by about 25%; uncorrected, quantification counts the contamination as sample and film thickness is overestimated, while a rough surface broadens the effective emission-angle distribution so angle-resolved thickness drifts systematically at high angles.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在 0°、45°、60° 三個出射角量同一片自然氧化矽的 Si 2p 比值，以上式分別算厚度，三者應一致在 ±0.2 nm 內；再用橢偏儀或 TEM 截面量同一片，比較絕對值。λ 值以 NIST SRD 71 資料庫或 TPP-2M 公式取得並記錄所用參數。","textEn":"Measure the Si 2p ratio of one native-oxide wafer at emission angles of 0°, 45° and 60°, compute the thickness from each with the formula and require agreement within ±0.2 nm; then compare the absolute value with ellipsometry or a TEM cross-section of the same wafer. Obtain λ from the NIST SRD 71 database or the TPP-2M formula and record the parameters used.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「表面靈敏度與資訊深度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Surface sensitivity and information depth\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在 0°、45°、60° 三個出射角量同一片自然氧化矽的 Si 2p 比值，以上式分別算厚度，三者應一致在 ±0.2 nm 內。","安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure the Si 2p ratio of one native-oxide wafer at emission angles of 0°, 45° and 60°, compute the thickness from each with the formula and require agreement within ±0.2 nm.","An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在 0°、45°、60° 三個出射角量同一片自然氧化矽的 Si 2p 比值，以上式分別算厚度，三者應一致在 ±0.2 nm 內；再用橢偏儀或 TEM 截面量同一片，比較絕對值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the Si 2p ratio of one native-oxide wafer at emission angles of 0°, 45° and 60°, compute the thickness from each with the formula and require agreement within ±0.2 nm; then compare the absolute value with ellipsometry or a TEM cross-section of the same wafer. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a447-v12-08","title":"表面靈敏度與資訊深度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Surface sensitivity and information depth: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「非彈性平均自由徑 λ」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Inelastic mean free path λ” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"表面 1 nm 的碳污染會把下層訊號衰減約 25%，若不校正，定量把污染當成樣品成分，膜厚被高估；粗糙表面讓有效出射角分佈變寬，角解析厚度在高角度處系統性偏離。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A 1 nm carbon contamination layer attenuates the underlying signal by about 25%; uncorrected, quantification counts the contamination as sample and film thickness is overestimated, while a rough surface broadens the effective emission-angle distribution so angle-resolved thickness drifts systematically at high angles. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：因此 XPS 的資訊深度約 10 nm，傾斜樣品可以把它縮到幾 nm，這是角解析 XPS 量超薄膜厚度的基礎。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The information depth is therefore about 10 nm, and tilting the sample shrinks it to a few nanometres, the basis of angle-resolved XPS thickness measurement of ultrathin films.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"表面 1 nm 的碳污染會把下層訊號衰減約 25%，若不校正，定量把污染當成樣品成分，膜厚被高估；粗糙表面讓有效出射角分佈變寬，角解析厚度在高角度處系統性偏離。","textEn":"A 1 nm carbon contamination layer attenuates the underlying signal by about 25%; uncorrected, quantification counts the contamination as sample and film thickness is overestimated, while a rough surface broadens the effective emission-angle distribution so angle-resolved thickness drifts systematically at high angles.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「表面靈敏度與資訊深度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Surface sensitivity and information depth\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。","表面 1 nm 的碳污染會把下層訊號衰減約 25%，若不校正，定量把污染當成樣品成分，膜厚被高估；粗糙表面讓有效出射角分佈變寬，角解析厚度在高角度處系統性偏離。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution.","A 1 nm carbon contamination layer attenuates the underlying signal by about 25%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"表面 1 nm 的碳污染會把下層訊號衰減約 25%，若不校正，定量把污染當成樣品成分，膜厚被高估；粗糙表面讓有效出射角分佈變寬，角解析厚度在高角度處系統性偏離。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A 1 nm carbon contamination layer attenuates the underlying signal by about 25%; uncorrected, quantification counts the contamination as sample and film thickness is overestimated, while a rough surface broadens the effective emission-angle distribution so angle-resolved thickness drifts systematically at high angles. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a447-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「X 光源與單色器設計」與「半球型能量分析器與偵測器」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"X-ray source and monochromator design\" and \"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a447-v12-09","title":"X 光源與單色器設計：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"X-ray source and monochromator design: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「Al 陽極與石英單色器」如何決定X 光光電子能譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Al anode and quartz monochromator” determines the key performance of “X-ray photoelectron spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"電子束轟擊鋁陽極產生 Al Kα 特徵線，但原始譜線寬約 0.85 eV，還伴隨 Kα₃,₄ 衛星峰與連續的制動輻射。單色器用彎曲的石英單晶以布拉格繞射只挑出 Kα₁,₂ 核心，線寬縮到約 0.25 eV，並去除衛星與背景；陽極、晶體與樣品位於同一個 Rowland 圓上，晶體經彎曲與研磨使聚焦同時滿足布拉格條件。微聚焦的電子束讓 X 光斑小到 10 µm 等級，可做小區域分析與影像。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「Al 陽極與石英單色器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Electron bombardment of an aluminium anode produces the Al Kα line, but the raw line is about 0.85 eV wide and comes with Kα₃,₄ satellites and a bremsstrahlung continuum. A monochromator uses a bent quartz single crystal in Bragg diffraction to select only the Kα₁,₂ core, narrowing the width to about 0.25 eV and removing satellites and background; anode, crystal and sample lie on one Rowland circle, and the crystal is bent and ground so that focusing and the Bragg condition hold together. A microfocused electron beam makes X-ray spots down to the 10 µm scale for small-area analysis and imaging. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Al anode and quartz monochromator”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Al Kα 波長 λ = 0.834 nm，石英 (10-10) 面間距 d = 0.4255 nm：布拉格 sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980，θ ≈ 78.5°，接近背向繞射使能量色散最強。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For Al Kα, λ = 0.834 nm and the quartz (10-10) spacing is d = 0.4255 nm: Bragg sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980, so θ ≈ 78.5°, near back-reflection where energy dispersion is strongest.","failure":"常見誤解：「單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「Al 陽極與石英單色器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Al anode and quartz monochromator”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-09-k1","title":"X 光源與單色器設計","titleEn":"X-ray source and monochromator design","text":"電子束轟擊鋁陽極產生 Al Kα 特徵線，但原始譜線寬約 0.85 eV，還伴隨 Kα₃,₄ 衛星峰與連續的制動輻射。單色器用彎曲的石英單晶以布拉格繞射只挑出 Kα₁,₂ 核心，線寬縮到約 0.25 eV，並去除衛星與背景；陽極、晶體與樣品位於同一個 Rowland 圓上，晶體經彎曲與研磨使聚焦同時滿足布拉格條件。","textEn":"Electron bombardment of an aluminium anode produces the Al Kα line, but the raw line is about 0.85 eV wide and comes with Kα₃,₄ satellites and a bremsstrahlung continuum. A monochromator uses a bent quartz single crystal in Bragg diffraction to select only the Kα₁,₂ core, narrowing the width to about 0.25 eV and removing satellites and background; anode, crystal and sample lie on one Rowland circle, and the crystal is bent and ground so that focusing and the Bragg condition hold together.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「X 光源與單色器設計」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"X-ray source and monochromator design\" is correct?","options":["電子束轟擊鋁陽極產生 Al Kα 特徵線，但原始譜線寬約 0.85 eV，還伴隨 Kα₃,₄ 衛星峰與連續的制動輻射。","單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。","通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。"],"optionsEn":["Electron bombardment of an aluminium anode produces the Al Kα line, but the raw line is about 0.85 eV wide and comes with Kα₃,₄ satellites and a bremsstrahlung continuum.","A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution.","Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate."],"answer":0,"explanation":"電子束轟擊鋁陽極產生 Al Kα 特徵線，但原始譜線寬約 0.85 eV，還伴隨 Kα₃,₄ 衛星峰與連續的制動輻射。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Electron bombardment of an aluminium anode produces the Al Kα line, but the raw line is about 0.85 eV wide and comes with Kα₃,₄ satellites and a bremsstrahlung continuum. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a447-v12-10","title":"X 光源與單色器設計：定量估算","titleEn":"X-ray source and monochromator design: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Al 陽極與石英單色器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Al anode and quartz monochromator” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Al Kα 波長 λ = 0.834 nm，石英 (10-10) 面間距 d = 0.4255 nm：布拉格 sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980，θ ≈ 78.5°，接近背向繞射使能量色散最強。能量解析 ΔE/E = cotθ·Δθ，cot 78.5° = 0.203；若光斑與晶體幾何給 Δθ = 1 mrad，ΔE = 1486.6×0.203×0.001 ≈ 0.30 eV，與 0.25 eV 等級的單色線寬一致；Δθ 放寬到 3 mrad 時線寬變為 0.9 eV，單色化的好處消失。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For Al Kα, λ = 0.834 nm and the quartz (10-10) spacing is d = 0.4255 nm: Bragg sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980, so θ ≈ 78.5°, near back-reflection where energy dispersion is strongest. Energy resolution follows ΔE/E = cotθ·Δθ with cot 78.5° = 0.203; if spot and crystal geometry give Δθ = 1 mrad, ΔE = 1486.6×0.203×0.001 ≈ 0.30 eV, consistent with a monochromated linewidth near 0.25 eV, whereas Δθ of 3 mrad makes 0.9 eV and the benefit of monochromation disappears. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以清潔銀片的 Ag 3d₅/₂ 峰在低通能下量 FWHM，單色器對準正確時應在 0.45 到 0.55 eV；檢查譜圖在主峰高結合能側 9.8 eV 處是否還有 Kα₃,₄ 衛星殘留；用 Faraday 杯或螢光屏確認 X 光斑位置與分析器視野重合，並記錄陽極功率對計數率的線性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM on clean silver at low pass energy, which with a correctly aligned monochromator should be 0.45 to 0.55 eV; check for residual Kα₃,₄ satellites 9.8 eV above the main peak on the binding-energy scale; confirm with a Faraday cup or phosphor screen that the X-ray spot coincides with the analyser field of view, and record count rate versus anode power for linearity.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Al Kα 波長 λ = 0.834 nm，石英 (10-10) 面間距 d = 0.4255 nm：布拉格 sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980，θ ≈ 78.5°，接近背向繞射使能量色散最強。能量解析 ΔE/E = cotθ·Δθ，cot 78.5° = 0.203；若光斑與晶體幾何給 Δθ = 1 mrad，ΔE = 1486.6×0.203×0.001 ≈ 0.30 eV，與 0.25 eV 等級的單色線寬一致；Δθ 放寬到 3 mrad 時線寬變為 0.9 eV，單色化的好處消失。","textEn":"For Al Kα, λ = 0.834 nm and the quartz (10-10) spacing is d = 0.4255 nm: Bragg sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980, so θ ≈ 78.5°, near back-reflection where energy dispersion is strongest. Energy resolution follows ΔE/E = cotθ·Δθ with cot 78.5° = 0.203; if spot and crystal geometry give Δθ = 1 mrad, ΔE = 1486.6×0.203×0.001 ≈ 0.30 eV, consistent with a monochromated linewidth near 0.25 eV, whereas Δθ of 3 mrad makes 0.9 eV and the benefit of monochromation disappears.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「X 光源與單色器設計」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"X-ray source and monochromator design\", which statement holds?","options":["譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。","Al Kα 波長 λ = 0.834 nm，石英 (10-10) 面間距 d = 0.4255 nm：布拉格 sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980，θ ≈ 78.5°，接近背向繞射使能量色散最強。","安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。"],"optionsEn":["The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio.","For Al Kα, λ = 0.834 nm and the quartz (10-10) spacing is d = 0.4255 nm: Bragg sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980, so θ ≈ 78.5°, near back-reflection where energy dispersion is strongest.","An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Al Kα 波長 λ = 0.834 nm，石英 (10-10) 面間距 d = 0.4255 nm：布拉格 sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980，θ ≈ 78.5°，接近背向繞射使能量色散最強。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For Al Kα, λ = 0.834 nm and the quartz (10-10) spacing is d = 0.4255 nm: Bragg sinθ = λ/(2d) = 0.834/0.851 = 0.980, so θ ≈ 78.5°, near back-reflection where energy dispersion is strongest. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a447-v12-11","title":"X 光源與單色器設計：量測與驗證","titleEn":"X-ray source and monochromator design: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「Al 陽極與石英單色器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Al anode and quartz monochromator” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以清潔銀片的 Ag 3d₅/₂ 峰在低通能下量 FWHM，單色器對準正確時應在 0.45 到 0.55 eV；檢查譜圖在主峰高結合能側 9.8 eV 處是否還有 Kα₃,₄ 衛星殘留；用 Faraday 杯或螢光屏確認 X 光斑位置與分析器視野重合，並記錄陽極功率對計數率的線性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM on clean silver at low pass energy, which with a correctly aligned monochromator should be 0.45 to 0.55 eV; check for residual Kα₃,₄ satellites 9.8 eV above the main peak on the binding-energy scale; confirm with a Faraday cup or phosphor screen that the X-ray spot coincides with the analyser field of view, and record count rate versus anode power for linearity. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：陽極鋁膜被電子束局部燒穿露出銅底材，譜圖出現 Cu Lα 激發的鬼峰；單色晶體或陽極位置偏離 Rowland 圓時，光斑變大、強度掉一半以上，而操作者常誤以為是樣品訊號弱。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An anode whose aluminium film is burned through locally exposes the copper base and ghost peaks excited by Cu Lα appear; when the crystal or anode drifts off the Rowland circle the spot grows and intensity falls by more than half, which operators often misattribute to a weak sample.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以清潔銀片的 Ag 3d₅/₂ 峰在低通能下量 FWHM，單色器對準正確時應在 0.45 到 0.55 eV；檢查譜圖在主峰高結合能側 9.8 eV 處是否還有 Kα₃,₄ 衛星殘留；用 Faraday 杯或螢光屏確認 X 光斑位置與分析器視野重合，並記錄陽極功率對計數率的線性。","textEn":"Measure the Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM on clean silver at low pass energy, which with a correctly aligned monochromator should be 0.45 to 0.55 eV; check for residual Kα₃,₄ satellites 9.8 eV above the main peak on the binding-energy scale; confirm with a Faraday cup or phosphor screen that the X-ray spot coincides with the analyser field of view, and record count rate versus anode power for linearity.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「X 光源與單色器設計」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"X-ray source and monochromator design\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。","以清潔銀片的 Ag 3d₅/₂ 峰在低通能下量 FWHM，單色器對準正確時應在 0.45 到 0.55 eV。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment.","Measure the Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM on clean silver at low pass energy, which with a correctly aligned monochromator should be 0.45 to 0.55 eV."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以清潔銀片的 Ag 3d₅/₂ 峰在低通能下量 FWHM，單色器對準正確時應在 0.45 到 0.55 eV；檢查譜圖在主峰高結合能側 9.8 eV 處是否還有 Kα₃,₄ 衛星殘留；用 Faraday 杯或螢光屏確認 X 光斑位置與分析器視野重合，並記錄陽極功率對計數率的線性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM on clean silver at low pass energy, which with a correctly aligned monochromator should be 0.45 to 0.55 eV; check for residual Kα₃,₄ satellites 9.8 eV above the main peak on the binding-energy scale; confirm with a Faraday cup or phosphor screen that the X-ray spot coincides with the analyser field of view, and record count rate versus anode power for linearity. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a447-v12-12","title":"X 光源與單色器設計：失效診斷","titleEn":"X-ray source and monochromator design: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Al 陽極與石英單色器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Al anode and quartz monochromator” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"陽極鋁膜被電子束局部燒穿露出銅底材，譜圖出現 Cu Lα 激發的鬼峰；單色晶體或陽極位置偏離 Rowland 圓時，光斑變大、強度掉一半以上，而操作者常誤以為是樣品訊號弱。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An anode whose aluminium film is burned through locally exposes the copper base and ghost peaks excited by Cu Lα appear; when the crystal or anode drifts off the Rowland circle the spot grows and intensity falls by more than half, which operators often misattribute to a weak sample. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：微聚焦的電子束讓 X 光斑小到 10 µm 等級，可做小區域分析與影像。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A microfocused electron beam makes X-ray spots down to the 10 µm scale for small-area analysis and imaging.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"陽極鋁膜被電子束局部燒穿露出銅底材，譜圖出現 Cu Lα 激發的鬼峰；單色晶體或陽極位置偏離 Rowland 圓時，光斑變大、強度掉一半以上，而操作者常誤以為是樣品訊號弱。","textEn":"An anode whose aluminium film is burned through locally exposes the copper base and ghost peaks excited by Cu Lα appear; when the crystal or anode drifts off the Rowland circle the spot grows and intensity falls by more than half, which operators often misattribute to a weak sample.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「X 光源與單色器設計」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"X-ray source and monochromator design\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["陽極鋁膜被電子束局部燒穿露出銅底材，譜圖出現 Cu Lα 激發的鬼峰。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。"],"optionsEn":["An anode whose aluminium film is burned through locally exposes the copper base and ghost peaks excited by Cu Lα appear.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate."],"answer":0,"explanation":"陽極鋁膜被電子束局部燒穿露出銅底材，譜圖出現 Cu Lα 激發的鬼峰；單色晶體或陽極位置偏離 Rowland 圓時，光斑變大、強度掉一半以上，而操作者常誤以為是樣品訊號弱。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An anode whose aluminium film is burned through locally exposes the copper base and ghost peaks excited by Cu Lα appear; when the crystal or anode drifts off the Rowland circle the spot grows and intensity falls by more than half, which operators often misattribute to a weak sample. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a447-v12-13","title":"半球型能量分析器與偵測器：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「半球型分析器與通能」如何決定X 光光電子能譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hemispherical analyser and pass energy” determines the key performance of “X-ray photoelectron spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"光電子先由靜電透鏡收集並減速到固定的通能 E_p，再進入兩個同心半球之間的徑向電場；只有能量等於 E_p 的電子沿中央軌道到達出口，能量偏高或偏低者打到內外球。分析器的絕對解析度與通能成正比，與狹縫寬度、球半徑和入射角展寬有關，所以高解析譜用 10 到 20 eV 的通能，巡掃用 100 到 160 eV 以換取計數率。出口處以多通道電子倍增器或延遲線偵測器平行記錄一段能量範圍，提高效率並支援能量分散的快照模式。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「半球型分析器與通能」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Photoelectrons are collected by an electrostatic lens and retarded to a fixed pass energy E_p before entering the radial field between two concentric hemispheres; only electrons at E_p follow the central orbit to the exit, while faster or slower ones strike the outer or inner sphere. The absolute resolution scales with pass energy and depends on slit width, sphere radius and angular spread, so high-resolution spectra use 10 to 20 eV pass energy and survey scans use 100 to 160 eV to buy count rate. At the exit a multichannel electron multiplier or delay-line detector records an energy window in parallel, raising efficiency and enabling energy-dispersive snapshot modes. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Hemispherical analyser and pass energy”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：半球分析器解析度 ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The hemispherical resolution is ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4).","failure":"常見誤解：「通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「半球型分析器與通能」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Hemispherical analyser and pass energy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-13-k1","title":"半球型能量分析器與偵測器","titleEn":"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector","text":"光電子先由靜電透鏡收集並減速到固定的通能 E_p，再進入兩個同心半球之間的徑向電場；只有能量等於 E_p 的電子沿中央軌道到達出口，能量偏高或偏低者打到內外球。分析器的絕對解析度與通能成正比，與狹縫寬度、球半徑和入射角展寬有關，所以高解析譜用 10 到 20 eV 的通能，巡掃用 100 到 160 eV 以換取計數率。","textEn":"Photoelectrons are collected by an electrostatic lens and retarded to a fixed pass energy E_p before entering the radial field between two concentric hemispheres; only electrons at E_p follow the central orbit to the exit, while faster or slower ones strike the outer or inner sphere. The absolute resolution scales with pass energy and depends on slit width, sphere radius and angular spread, so high-resolution spectra use 10 to 20 eV pass energy and survey scans use 100 to 160 eV to buy count rate.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「半球型能量分析器與偵測器」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector\" is correct?","options":["通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。","光電子先由靜電透鏡收集並減速到固定的通能 E_p，再進入兩個同心半球之間的徑向電場；只有能量等於 E_p 的電子沿中央軌道到達出口，能量偏高或偏低者打到內外球。","只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。"],"optionsEn":["Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate.","Photoelectrons are collected by an electrostatic lens and retarded to a fixed pass energy E_p before entering the radial field between two concentric hemispheres.","Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample."],"answer":1,"explanation":"光電子先由靜電透鏡收集並減速到固定的通能 E_p，再進入兩個同心半球之間的徑向電場；只有能量等於 E_p 的電子沿中央軌道到達出口，能量偏高或偏低者打到內外球。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Photoelectrons are collected by an electrostatic lens and retarded to a fixed pass energy E_p before entering the radial field between two concentric hemispheres; only electrons at E_p follow the central orbit to the exit, while faster or slower ones strike the outer or inner sphere. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a447-v12-14","title":"半球型能量分析器與偵測器：定量估算","titleEn":"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「半球型分析器與通能」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hemispherical analyser and pass energy” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：半球分析器解析度 ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4)。取平均半徑 R₀ = 165 mm、狹縫 w = 1 mm、半接受角 α = 3°（0.052 rad）：w/(2R₀) = 3.0×10⁻³，α²/4 = 6.8×10⁻⁴，合計 3.7×10⁻³；E_p = 20 eV 時 ΔE ≈ 0.074 eV，E_p = 160 eV 時 ≈ 0.59 eV。與 0.25 eV 的 X 光線寬及 Ag 3d₅/₂ 約 0.30 eV 的本徵寬度合成：√(0.25² + 0.074² + 0.30²) ≈ 0.40 eV，解釋了低通能下實測約 0.45 eV 的峰寬；計數率約與 E_p 成正比，20 eV 比 160 eV 少約 8 倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The hemispherical resolution is ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4). With mean radius R₀ = 165 mm, slit w = 1 mm and half acceptance angle α = 3° (0.052 rad): w/(2R₀) = 3.0×10⁻³, α²/4 = 6.8×10⁻⁴, total 3.7×10⁻³; at E_p = 20 eV, ΔE ≈ 0.074 eV, and at 160 eV about 0.59 eV. Combined with the 0.25 eV X-ray width and the roughly 0.30 eV intrinsic width of Ag 3d₅/₂: √(0.25² + 0.074² + 0.30²) ≈ 0.40 eV, explaining the measured width near 0.45 eV at low pass energy; count rate scales roughly with E_p, about 8 times lower at 20 eV than at 160 eV. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在 5、10、20、40、80、160 eV 通能各量一次 Ag 3d₅/₂，把 FWHM 對 E_p 作圖，截距給出 X 光與本徵寬度的合成，斜率給出分析器項，與上式比較；同時記錄各通能的峰計數率，確認近似線性，並檢查偵測器在高計數率下的死時間修正。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure Ag 3d₅/₂ at pass energies of 5, 10, 20, 40, 80 and 160 eV, plot FWHM against E_p, and compare the intercept (X-ray plus intrinsic width) and slope (analyser term) with the formula; log the peak count rate at each pass energy to confirm near-linearity, and check the detector's dead-time correction at high rates.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"半球分析器解析度 ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4)。取平均半徑 R₀ = 165 mm、狹縫 w = 1 mm、半接受角 α = 3°（0.052 rad）：w/(2R₀) = 3.0×10⁻³，α²/4 = 6.8×10⁻⁴，合計 3.7×10⁻³；E_p = 20 eV 時 ΔE ≈ 0.074 eV，E_p = 160 eV 時 ≈ 0.59 eV。與 0.25 eV 的 X 光線寬及 Ag 3d₅/₂ 約 0.30 eV 的本徵寬度合成：√(0.25² + 0.074² + 0.30²) ≈ 0.40 eV，解釋了低通能下實測約 0.45 eV 的峰寬；計數率約與 E_p 成正比，20 eV 比 160 eV 少約 8 倍。","textEn":"The hemispherical resolution is ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4). With mean radius R₀ = 165 mm, slit w = 1 mm and half acceptance angle α = 3° (0.052 rad): w/(2R₀) = 3.0×10⁻³, α²/4 = 6.8×10⁻⁴, total 3.7×10⁻³; at E_p = 20 eV, ΔE ≈ 0.074 eV, and at 160 eV about 0.59 eV. Combined with the 0.25 eV X-ray width and the roughly 0.30 eV intrinsic width of Ag 3d₅/₂: √(0.25² + 0.074² + 0.30²) ≈ 0.40 eV, explaining the measured width near 0.45 eV at low pass energy; count rate scales roughly with E_p, about 8 times lower at 20 eV than at 160 eV.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「半球型能量分析器與偵測器」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector\", which statement holds?","options":["真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。","結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。","半球分析器解析度 ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4)。"],"optionsEn":["Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality.","Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment.","The hemispherical resolution is ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"半球分析器解析度 ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The hemispherical resolution is ΔE ≈ E_p·(w/(2R₀) + α²/4). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a447-v12-15","title":"半球型能量分析器與偵測器：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「半球型分析器與通能」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Hemispherical analyser and pass energy” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在 5、10、20、40、80、160 eV 通能各量一次 Ag 3d₅/₂，把 FWHM 對 E_p 作圖，截距給出 X 光與本徵寬度的合成，斜率給出分析器項，與上式比較；同時記錄各通能的峰計數率，確認近似線性，並檢查偵測器在高計數率下的死時間修正。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure Ag 3d₅/₂ at pass energies of 5, 10, 20, 40, 80 and 160 eV, plot FWHM against E_p, and compare the intercept (X-ray plus intrinsic width) and slope (analyser term) with the formula; log the peak count rate at each pass energy to confirm near-linearity, and check the detector's dead-time correction at high rates. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：半球內表面沉積污染或透鏡電壓漂移會讓中央軌道偏移，所有峰往同一方向移動 0.1 到 0.3 eV 且峰形不對稱；若只用固定的校正偏移修正，化學態判讀仍會錯，而偵測器某些通道老化會在快照譜上留下固定位置的凹陷。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Contamination on the hemisphere surfaces or drifting lens voltages shifts the central orbit, moving every peak 0.1 to 0.3 eV the same way with asymmetric shapes; a fixed calibration offset cannot repair chemical-state assignments, and aged detector channels leave dips at fixed positions in snapshot spectra.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在 5、10、20、40、80、160 eV 通能各量一次 Ag 3d₅/₂，把 FWHM 對 E_p 作圖，截距給出 X 光與本徵寬度的合成，斜率給出分析器項，與上式比較；同時記錄各通能的峰計數率，確認近似線性，並檢查偵測器在高計數率下的死時間修正。","textEn":"Measure Ag 3d₅/₂ at pass energies of 5, 10, 20, 40, 80 and 160 eV, plot FWHM against E_p, and compare the intercept (X-ray plus intrinsic width) and slope (analyser term) with the formula; log the peak count rate at each pass energy to confirm near-linearity, and check the detector's dead-time correction at high rates.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「半球型能量分析器與偵測器」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector\"?","options":["在 5、10、20、40、80、160 eV 通能各量一次 Ag 3d₅/₂，把 FWHM 對 E_p 作圖，截距給出 X 光與本徵寬度的合成，斜率給出分析器項，與上式比較。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。"],"optionsEn":["Measure Ag 3d₅/₂ at pass energies of 5, 10, 20, 40, 80 and 160 eV, plot FWHM against E_p, and compare the intercept (X-ray plus intrinsic width) and slope (analyser term) with the formula.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在 5、10、20、40、80、160 eV 通能各量一次 Ag 3d₅/₂，把 FWHM 對 E_p 作圖，截距給出 X 光與本徵寬度的合成，斜率給出分析器項，與上式比較；同時記錄各通能的峰計數率，確認近似線性，並檢查偵測器在高計數率下的死時間修正。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure Ag 3d₅/₂ at pass energies of 5, 10, 20, 40, 80 and 160 eV, plot FWHM against E_p, and compare the intercept (X-ray plus intrinsic width) and slope (analyser term) with the formula; log the peak count rate at each pass energy to confirm near-linearity, and check the detector's dead-time correction at high rates. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a447-v12-16","title":"半球型能量分析器與偵測器：失效診斷","titleEn":"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「半球型分析器與通能」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Hemispherical analyser and pass energy” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"半球內表面沉積污染或透鏡電壓漂移會讓中央軌道偏移，所有峰往同一方向移動 0.1 到 0.3 eV 且峰形不對稱；若只用固定的校正偏移修正，化學態判讀仍會錯，而偵測器某些通道老化會在快照譜上留下固定位置的凹陷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Contamination on the hemisphere surfaces or drifting lens voltages shifts the central orbit, moving every peak 0.1 to 0.3 eV the same way with asymmetric shapes; a fixed calibration offset cannot repair chemical-state assignments, and aged detector channels leave dips at fixed positions in snapshot spectra. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：出口處以多通道電子倍增器或延遲線偵測器平行記錄一段能量範圍，提高效率並支援能量分散的快照模式。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: At the exit a multichannel electron multiplier or delay-line detector records an energy window in parallel, raising efficiency and enabling energy-dispersive snapshot modes.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"半球內表面沉積污染或透鏡電壓漂移會讓中央軌道偏移，所有峰往同一方向移動 0.1 到 0.3 eV 且峰形不對稱；若只用固定的校正偏移修正，化學態判讀仍會錯，而偵測器某些通道老化會在快照譜上留下固定位置的凹陷。","textEn":"Contamination on the hemisphere surfaces or drifting lens voltages shifts the central orbit, moving every peak 0.1 to 0.3 eV the same way with asymmetric shapes; a fixed calibration offset cannot repair chemical-state assignments, and aged detector channels leave dips at fixed positions in snapshot spectra.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「半球型能量分析器與偵測器」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Hemispherical energy analyser and detector\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","半球內表面沉積污染或透鏡電壓漂移會讓中央軌道偏移，所有峰往同一方向移動 0.1 到 0.3 eV 且峰形不對稱。","只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Contamination on the hemisphere surfaces or drifting lens voltages shifts the central orbit, moving every peak 0.1 to 0.3 eV the same way with asymmetric shapes.","Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample."],"answer":1,"explanation":"半球內表面沉積污染或透鏡電壓漂移會讓中央軌道偏移，所有峰往同一方向移動 0.1 到 0.3 eV 且峰形不對稱；若只用固定的校正偏移修正，化學態判讀仍會錯，而偵測器某些通道老化會在快照譜上留下固定位置的凹陷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Contamination on the hemisphere surfaces or drifting lens voltages shifts the central orbit, moving every peak 0.1 to 0.3 eV the same way with asymmetric shapes; a fixed calibration offset cannot repair chemical-state assignments, and aged detector channels leave dips at fixed positions in snapshot spectra. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a447-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「能量尺度校正與電荷補償」與「定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation\" and \"Quantification, detection limits and noise\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a447-v12-17","title":"能量尺度校正與電荷補償：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「Au/Ag/Cu 能量尺度基準」如何決定X 光光電子能譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Au/Ag/Cu energy-scale references” determines the key performance of “X-ray photoelectron spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"能量尺度以 ISO 15472 規定的三個金屬參考峰校正：Au 4f₇/₂ = 83.96 eV、Ag 3d₅/₂ = 368.21 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.62 eV，涵蓋 85 到 933 eV 的範圍，可同時決定零點偏移與線性誤差。絕緣樣品在 X 光下持續失去電子而帶正電，峰向高結合能移動數 eV 並變寬，需要低能電子與離子的電荷中和槍補償；殘餘位移通常以外來碳 C 1s = 284.8 eV 做參考，但這個方法本身有 ±0.3 eV 的不確定度。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「Au/Ag/Cu 能量尺度基準」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The energy scale is calibrated with the three metal reference peaks prescribed by ISO 15472, Au 4f₇/₂ = 83.96 eV, Ag 3d₅/₂ = 368.21 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.62 eV, which span 85 to 933 eV and determine both the zero offset and the linearity error. Insulating samples lose electrons under X-rays and charge positively, shifting peaks several electronvolts to higher binding energy and broadening them, so a charge-neutraliser supplying low-energy electrons and ions is required; residual shift is usually referenced to adventitious carbon C 1s = 284.8 eV, a method that itself carries about ±0.3 eV uncertainty. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Au/Ag/Cu energy-scale references”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：量得 Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV：零點偏移 +0.14 eV，線性誤差 (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴（165 ppm）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Measured Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV give a zero offset of +0.14 eV and a linearity error of (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴ (165 ppm).","failure":"常見誤解：「只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「Au/Ag/Cu 能量尺度基準」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Au/Ag/Cu energy-scale references”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-17-k1","title":"能量尺度校正與電荷補償","titleEn":"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation","text":"能量尺度以 ISO 15472 規定的三個金屬參考峰校正：Au 4f₇/₂ = 83.96 eV、Ag 3d₅/₂ = 368.21 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.62 eV，涵蓋 85 到 933 eV 的範圍，可同時決定零點偏移與線性誤差。絕緣樣品在 X 光下持續失去電子而帶正電，峰向高結合能移動數 eV 並變寬，需要低能電子與離子的電荷中和槍補償；殘餘位移通常以外來碳 C 1s = 284.8 eV 做參考，但這個方法本身有 ±0.3 eV 的不確定度。","textEn":"The energy scale is calibrated with the three metal reference peaks prescribed by ISO 15472, Au 4f₇/₂ = 83.96 eV, Ag 3d₅/₂ = 368.21 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.62 eV, which span 85 to 933 eV and determine both the zero offset and the linearity error. Insulating samples lose electrons under X-rays and charge positively, shifting peaks several electronvolts to higher binding energy and broadening them, so a charge-neutraliser supplying low-energy electrons and ions is required; residual shift is usually referenced to adventitious carbon C 1s = 284.8 eV, a method that itself carries about ±0.3 eV uncertainty.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「能量尺度校正與電荷補償」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation\" is correct?","options":["只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。","譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。","能量尺度以 ISO 15472 規定的三個金屬參考峰校正：Au 4f₇/₂ = 83.96 eV、Ag 3d₅/₂ = 368.21 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.62 eV，涵蓋 85 到 933 eV 的範圍，可同時決定零點偏移與線性誤差。"],"optionsEn":["Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample.","The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio.","The energy scale is calibrated with the three metal reference peaks prescribed by ISO 15472, Au 4f₇/₂ = 83.96 eV, Ag 3d₅/₂ = 368.21 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.62 eV, which span 85 to 933 eV and determine both the zero offset and the linearity error."],"answer":2,"explanation":"能量尺度以 ISO 15472 規定的三個金屬參考峰校正：Au 4f₇/₂ = 83.96 eV、Ag 3d₅/₂ = 368.21 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.62 eV，涵蓋 85 到 933 eV 的範圍，可同時決定零點偏移與線性誤差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The energy scale is calibrated with the three metal reference peaks prescribed by ISO 15472, Au 4f₇/₂ = 83.96 eV, Ag 3d₅/₂ = 368.21 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.62 eV, which span 85 to 933 eV and determine both the zero offset and the linearity error. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a447-v12-18","title":"能量尺度校正與電荷補償：定量估算","titleEn":"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Au/Ag/Cu 能量尺度基準」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Au/Ag/Cu energy-scale references” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：量得 Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV：零點偏移 +0.14 eV，線性誤差 (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴（165 ppm）。修正式 E_true = E_meas − 0.14 − 1.65×10⁻⁴×(E_meas − 84.10)；對 O 1s 在 532.0 eV 的峰，修正量為 0.14 + 0.074 = 0.21 eV。ISO 15472 的允收要求是三個參考峰的殘差都在 ±0.1 eV 內，此例需調整分析器的能量尺度係數後重量。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Measured Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV give a zero offset of +0.14 eV and a linearity error of (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴ (165 ppm). The correction is E_true = E_meas − 0.14 − 1.65×10⁻⁴×(E_meas − 84.10); for an O 1s peak at 532.0 eV the correction is 0.14 + 0.074 = 0.21 eV. ISO 15472 acceptance asks for residuals within ±0.1 eV at all three references, so this case needs the analyser's energy-scale coefficient adjusted and re-measured. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：每月在濺射清潔的 Au、Ag、Cu 箔上量三個參考峰（低通能、同一透鏡模式），記錄偏移與線性，超出 ±0.1 eV 即重新校正；電荷補償用 PET 或 PTFE 等絕緣標準片，檢查 C 1s 的 CF₂ 峰在 292 eV 附近且 FWHM 不因充電而變寬，並比較中和槍開關前後的峰位與峰寬。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Each month measure the three reference peaks on sputter-cleaned Au, Ag and Cu foils at low pass energy in one lens mode, log offset and linearity, and recalibrate whenever residuals exceed ±0.1 eV; test charge compensation with insulating standards such as PET or PTFE, checking that the CF₂ component of C 1s sits near 292 eV with no charging broadening, and compare peak positions and widths with the neutraliser on and off.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"量得 Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV：零點偏移 +0.14 eV，線性誤差 (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴（165 ppm）。修正式 E_true = E_meas − 0.14 − 1.65×10⁻⁴×(E_meas − 84.10)；對 O 1s 在 532.0 eV 的峰，修正量為 0.14 + 0.074 = 0.21 eV。ISO 15472 的允收要求是三個參考峰的殘差都在 ±0.1 eV 內，此例需調整分析器的能量尺度係數後重量。","textEn":"Measured Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV give a zero offset of +0.14 eV and a linearity error of (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴ (165 ppm). The correction is E_true = E_meas − 0.14 − 1.65×10⁻⁴×(E_meas − 84.10); for an O 1s peak at 532.0 eV the correction is 0.14 + 0.074 = 0.21 eV. ISO 15472 acceptance asks for residuals within ±0.1 eV at all three references, so this case needs the analyser's energy-scale coefficient adjusted and re-measured.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「能量尺度校正與電荷補償」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation\", which statement holds?","options":["量得 Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV：零點偏移 +0.14 eV，線性誤差 (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴（165 ppm）。","安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。","X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。"],"optionsEn":["Measured Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV give a zero offset of +0.14 eV and a linearity error of (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴ (165 ppm).","An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on.","X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres."],"answer":0,"explanation":"量得 Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV、Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV：零點偏移 +0.14 eV，線性誤差 (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴（165 ppm）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Measured Au 4f₇/₂ = 84.10 eV and Cu 2p₃/₂ = 932.90 eV give a zero offset of +0.14 eV and a linearity error of (0.28 − 0.14)/(932.62 − 83.96) = 1.65×10⁻⁴ (165 ppm). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a447-v12-19","title":"能量尺度校正與電荷補償：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「Au/Ag/Cu 能量尺度基準」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Au/Ag/Cu energy-scale references” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"每月在濺射清潔的 Au、Ag、Cu 箔上量三個參考峰（低通能、同一透鏡模式），記錄偏移與線性，超出 ±0.1 eV 即重新校正；電荷補償用 PET 或 PTFE 等絕緣標準片，檢查 C 1s 的 CF₂ 峰在 292 eV 附近且 FWHM 不因充電而變寬，並比較中和槍開關前後的峰位與峰寬。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Each month measure the three reference peaks on sputter-cleaned Au, Ag and Cu foils at low pass energy in one lens mode, log offset and linearity, and recalibrate whenever residuals exceed ±0.1 eV; test charge compensation with insulating standards such as PET or PTFE, checking that the CF₂ component of C 1s sits near 292 eV with no charging broadening, and compare peak positions and widths with the neutraliser on and off. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：導電樣品以 C 1s = 284.8 eV 強行參考，會把本來正確的能量尺度平移 0.2 到 0.5 eV，化學態判讀全錯；絕緣樣品中和不足時，同一元素的峰因局部充電不均分裂成兩個，被誤判為兩種化學態。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Forcing C 1s = 284.8 eV referencing on a conducting sample shifts an already correct scale by 0.2 to 0.5 eV and corrupts every chemical-state assignment; an under-neutralised insulator shows peaks split in two by non-uniform local charging, which are mistaken for two chemical states.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每月在濺射清潔的 Au、Ag、Cu 箔上量三個參考峰（低通能、同一透鏡模式），記錄偏移與線性，超出 ±0.1 eV 即重新校正；電荷補償用 PET 或 PTFE 等絕緣標準片，檢查 C 1s 的 CF₂ 峰在 292 eV 附近且 FWHM 不因充電而變寬，並比較中和槍開關前後的峰位與峰寬。","textEn":"Each month measure the three reference peaks on sputter-cleaned Au, Ag and Cu foils at low pass energy in one lens mode, log offset and linearity, and recalibrate whenever residuals exceed ±0.1 eV; test charge compensation with insulating standards such as PET or PTFE, checking that the CF₂ component of C 1s sits near 292 eV with no charging broadening, and compare peak positions and widths with the neutraliser on and off.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「能量尺度校正與電荷補償」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","每月在濺射清潔的 Au、Ag、Cu 箔上量三個參考峰（低通能、同一透鏡模式），記錄偏移與線性，超出 ±0.1 eV 即重新校正。","單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Each month measure the three reference peaks on sputter-cleaned Au, Ag and Cu foils at low pass energy in one lens mode, log offset and linearity, and recalibrate whenever residuals exceed ±0.1 eV.","A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每月在濺射清潔的 Au、Ag、Cu 箔上量三個參考峰（低通能、同一透鏡模式），記錄偏移與線性，超出 ±0.1 eV 即重新校正；電荷補償用 PET 或 PTFE 等絕緣標準片，檢查 C 1s 的 CF₂ 峰在 292 eV 附近且 FWHM 不因充電而變寬，並比較中和槍開關前後的峰位與峰寬。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Each month measure the three reference peaks on sputter-cleaned Au, Ag and Cu foils at low pass energy in one lens mode, log offset and linearity, and recalibrate whenever residuals exceed ±0.1 eV; test charge compensation with insulating standards such as PET or PTFE, checking that the CF₂ component of C 1s sits near 292 eV with no charging broadening, and compare peak positions and widths with the neutraliser on and off. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a447-v12-20","title":"能量尺度校正與電荷補償：失效診斷","titleEn":"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Au/Ag/Cu 能量尺度基準」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Au/Ag/Cu energy-scale references” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"導電樣品以 C 1s = 284.8 eV 強行參考，會把本來正確的能量尺度平移 0.2 到 0.5 eV，化學態判讀全錯；絕緣樣品中和不足時，同一元素的峰因局部充電不均分裂成兩個，被誤判為兩種化學態。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Forcing C 1s = 284.8 eV referencing on a conducting sample shifts an already correct scale by 0.2 to 0.5 eV and corrupts every chemical-state assignment; an under-neutralised insulator shows peaks split in two by non-uniform local charging, which are mistaken for two chemical states. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：絕緣樣品在 X 光下持續失去電子而帶正電，峰向高結合能移動數 eV 並變寬，需要低能電子與離子的電荷中和槍補償；殘餘位移通常以外來碳 C 1s = 284.8 eV 做參考，但這個方法本身有 ±0.3 eV 的不確定度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Insulating samples lose electrons under X-rays and charge positively, shifting peaks several electronvolts to higher binding energy and broadening them, so a charge-neutraliser supplying low-energy electrons and ions is required; residual shift is usually referenced to adventitious carbon C 1s = 284.8 eV, a method that itself carries about ±0.3 eV uncertainty.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"導電樣品以 C 1s = 284.8 eV 強行參考，會把本來正確的能量尺度平移 0.2 到 0.5 eV，化學態判讀全錯；絕緣樣品中和不足時，同一元素的峰因局部充電不均分裂成兩個，被誤判為兩種化學態。","textEn":"Forcing C 1s = 284.8 eV referencing on a conducting sample shifts an already correct scale by 0.2 to 0.5 eV and corrupts every chemical-state assignment; an under-neutralised insulator shows peaks split in two by non-uniform local charging, which are mistaken for two chemical states.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「能量尺度校正與電荷補償」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Energy-scale calibration and charge compensation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。","導電樣品以 C 1s = 284.8 eV 強行參考，會把本來正確的能量尺度平移 0.2 到 0.5 eV，化學態判讀全錯。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio.","Forcing C 1s = 284.8 eV referencing on a conducting sample shifts an already correct scale by 0.2 to 0.5 eV and corrupts every chemical-state assignment."],"answer":2,"explanation":"導電樣品以 C 1s = 284.8 eV 強行參考，會把本來正確的能量尺度平移 0.2 到 0.5 eV，化學態判讀全錯；絕緣樣品中和不足時，同一元素的峰因局部充電不均分裂成兩個，被誤判為兩種化學態。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Forcing C 1s = 284.8 eV referencing on a conducting sample shifts an already correct scale by 0.2 to 0.5 eV and corrupts every chemical-state assignment; an under-neutralised insulator shows peaks split in two by non-uniform local charging, which are mistaken for two chemical states. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a447-v12-21","title":"定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Quantification, detection limits and noise: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「相對靈敏度因子與背景扣除」如何決定X 光光電子能譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Relative sensitivity factors and background subtraction” determines the key performance of “X-ray photoelectron spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"峰面積 I_i 正比於元素濃度 n_i、光游離截面 σ_i、非彈性平均自由徑 λ_i 與分析器傳輸函數 T(E_k)；把這些合併成相對靈敏度因子 S_i 後，原子百分比為 (I_i/S_i)/Σ(I_j/S_j)。面積必須先扣除 Shirley 或 Tougaard 背景，因為非彈性散射電子形成的階梯背景比峰本身還大。偵測極限由背景的 Poisson 統計決定，典型為 0.1 到 1 原子百分比，與元素截面、譜線重疊及取樣時間有關；均勻性假設不成立時，定量只代表資訊深度內的加權平均。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「相對靈敏度因子與背景扣除」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A peak area I_i is proportional to the element's concentration n_i, photoionisation cross-section σ_i, inelastic mean free path λ_i and the analyser transmission T(E_k); folding these into a relative sensitivity factor S_i gives the atomic fraction (I_i/S_i)/Σ(I_j/S_j). Areas must first be freed of a Shirley or Tougaard background, because the step-like background of inelastically scattered electrons is larger than the peak itself. The detection limit is set by Poisson statistics of the background, typically 0.1 to 1 atomic percent depending on cross-section, line overlap and acquisition time; when the homogeneity assumption fails, the result is only a weighted average over the information depth. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Relative sensitivity factors and background subtraction”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Scofield 截面（相對 C 1s = 1）：O 1s 2.93、Si 2p 0.82。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Scofield cross-sections relative to C 1s = 1: O 1s 2.93, Si 2p 0.82.","failure":"常見誤解：「譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「相對靈敏度因子與背景扣除」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Relative sensitivity factors and background subtraction”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-21-k1","title":"定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊","titleEn":"Quantification, detection limits and noise","text":"峰面積 I_i 正比於元素濃度 n_i、光游離截面 σ_i、非彈性平均自由徑 λ_i 與分析器傳輸函數 T(E_k)；把這些合併成相對靈敏度因子 S_i 後，原子百分比為 (I_i/S_i)/Σ(I_j/S_j)。面積必須先扣除 Shirley 或 Tougaard 背景，因為非彈性散射電子形成的階梯背景比峰本身還大。","textEn":"A peak area I_i is proportional to the element's concentration n_i, photoionisation cross-section σ_i, inelastic mean free path λ_i and the analyser transmission T(E_k); folding these into a relative sensitivity factor S_i gives the atomic fraction (I_i/S_i)/Σ(I_j/S_j). Areas must first be freed of a Shirley or Tougaard background, because the step-like background of inelastically scattered electrons is larger than the peak itself.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Quantification, detection limits and noise\" is correct?","options":["峰面積 I_i 正比於元素濃度 n_i、光游離截面 σ_i、非彈性平均自由徑 λ_i 與分析器傳輸函數 T(E_k)。","譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。","真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["A peak area I_i is proportional to the element's concentration n_i, photoionisation cross-section σ_i, inelastic mean free path λ_i and the analyser transmission T(E_k).","The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio.","Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"峰面積 I_i 正比於元素濃度 n_i、光游離截面 σ_i、非彈性平均自由徑 λ_i 與分析器傳輸函數 T(E_k)；把這些合併成相對靈敏度因子 S_i 後，原子百分比為 (I_i/S_i)/Σ(I_j/S_j)。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A peak area I_i is proportional to the element's concentration n_i, photoionisation cross-section σ_i, inelastic mean free path λ_i and the analyser transmission T(E_k); folding these into a relative sensitivity factor S_i gives the atomic fraction (I_i/S_i)/Σ(I_j/S_j). The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a447-v12-22","title":"定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊：定量估算","titleEn":"Quantification, detection limits and noise: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「相對靈敏度因子與背景扣除」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Relative sensitivity factors and background subtraction” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Scofield 截面（相對 C 1s = 1）：O 1s 2.93、Si 2p 0.82。某氧化矽樣品扣背景後 O 1s 面積 12 000、Si 2p 面積 2 000：I/σ 分別為 4 096 與 2 439，O 佔 62.7 at%、Si 37.3 at%，O/Si = 1.68；再用 λ ∝ E_k^0.75 修正動能差（O 1s 953 eV、Si 2p 1383 eV，比值 0.757），O 項變為 5 411，O/Si 升到 2.22，接近 SiO₂ 的 2。偵測極限：背景每通道 10⁴ 計數時 3√B = 300 計數；主元素峰 3×10⁵ 計數代表 100 at%，則 300 計數約為 0.1 at%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Scofield cross-sections relative to C 1s = 1: O 1s 2.93, Si 2p 0.82. For a silicon-oxide sample with background-subtracted areas of 12 000 (O 1s) and 2 000 (Si 2p), I/σ is 4 096 and 2 439, giving 62.7 at% O and 37.3 at% Si, O/Si = 1.68; correcting the kinetic-energy difference with λ ∝ E_k^0.75 (O 1s at 953 eV, Si 2p at 1383 eV, ratio 0.757) raises the O term to 5 411 and O/Si to 2.22, close to 2 for SiO₂. Detection limit: with 10⁴ background counts per channel, 3√B = 300 counts; if the major peak holds 3×10⁵ counts for 100 at%, 300 counts is about 0.1 at%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用已知化學計量的標準（如熱氧化 SiO₂、PET 的 C/O = 10/4）定量，結果應在 ±10% 相對誤差內；比較 Shirley 與 Tougaard 背景對面積的影響並記錄；對微量元素延長取樣時間，確認偵測極限按 1/√t 改善，並用 Ag 3d 計數率監控儀器靈敏度的長期漂移。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Quantify standards of known stoichiometry, such as thermal SiO₂ or PET with C/O = 10/4, expecting agreement within ±10% relative; compare the effect of Shirley versus Tougaard backgrounds on areas and record it; for trace elements extend acquisition and confirm that the detection limit improves as 1/√t, and monitor long-term sensitivity drift with the Ag 3d count rate.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Scofield 截面（相對 C 1s = 1）：O 1s 2.93、Si 2p 0.82。某氧化矽樣品扣背景後 O 1s 面積 12 000、Si 2p 面積 2 000：I/σ 分別為 4 096 與 2 439，O 佔 62.7 at%、Si 37.3 at%，O/Si = 1.68；再用 λ ∝ E_k^0.75 修正動能差（O 1s 953 eV、Si 2p 1383 eV，比值 0.757），O 項變為 5 411，O/Si 升到 2.22，接近 SiO₂ 的 2。偵測極限：背景每通道 10⁴ 計數時 3√B = 300 計數；主元素峰 3×10⁵ 計數代表 100 at%，則 300 計數約為 0.1 at%。","textEn":"Scofield cross-sections relative to C 1s = 1: O 1s 2.93, Si 2p 0.82. For a silicon-oxide sample with background-subtracted areas of 12 000 (O 1s) and 2 000 (Si 2p), I/σ is 4 096 and 2 439, giving 62.7 at% O and 37.3 at% Si, O/Si = 1.68; correcting the kinetic-energy difference with λ ∝ E_k^0.75 (O 1s at 953 eV, Si 2p at 1383 eV, ratio 0.757) raises the O term to 5 411 and O/Si to 2.22, close to 2 for SiO₂. Detection limit: with 10⁴ background counts per channel, 3√B = 300 counts; if the major peak holds 3×10⁵ counts for 100 at%, 300 counts is about 0.1 at%.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Quantification, detection limits and noise\", which statement holds?","options":["結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。","Scofield 截面（相對 C 1s = 1）：O 1s 2.93、Si 2p 0.82。","單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。"],"optionsEn":["Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment.","Scofield cross-sections relative to C 1s = 1: O 1s 2.93, Si 2p 0.82.","A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Scofield 截面（相對 C 1s = 1）：O 1s 2.93、Si 2p 0.82。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Scofield cross-sections relative to C 1s = 1: O 1s 2.93, Si 2p 0.82. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a447-v12-23","title":"定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Quantification, detection limits and noise: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「相對靈敏度因子與背景扣除」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Relative sensitivity factors and background subtraction” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用已知化學計量的標準（如熱氧化 SiO₂、PET 的 C/O = 10/4）定量，結果應在 ±10% 相對誤差內；比較 Shirley 與 Tougaard 背景對面積的影響並記錄；對微量元素延長取樣時間，確認偵測極限按 1/√t 改善，並用 Ag 3d 計數率監控儀器靈敏度的長期漂移。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Quantify standards of known stoichiometry, such as thermal SiO₂ or PET with C/O = 10/4, expecting agreement within ±10% relative; compare the effect of Shirley versus Tougaard backgrounds on areas and record it; for trace elements extend acquisition and confirm that the detection limit improves as 1/√t, and monitor long-term sensitivity drift with the Ag 3d count rate. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：忽略傳輸函數隨動能的變化，用另一台儀器的靈敏度因子做定量，高動能元素被系統性低估 20% 以上；對含碳污染層的樣品直接定量，則所有基材元素被稀釋，報告出的化學計量與真實材料不符。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Ignoring the kinetic-energy dependence of the transmission function and quantifying with another instrument's sensitivity factors underestimates high-kinetic-energy elements by more than 20%; quantifying a carbon-contaminated sample as measured dilutes every substrate element so the reported stoichiometry does not match the real material.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用已知化學計量的標準（如熱氧化 SiO₂、PET 的 C/O = 10/4）定量，結果應在 ±10% 相對誤差內；比較 Shirley 與 Tougaard 背景對面積的影響並記錄；對微量元素延長取樣時間，確認偵測極限按 1/√t 改善，並用 Ag 3d 計數率監控儀器靈敏度的長期漂移。","textEn":"Quantify standards of known stoichiometry, such as thermal SiO₂ or PET with C/O = 10/4, expecting agreement within ±10% relative; compare the effect of Shirley versus Tougaard backgrounds on areas and record it; for trace elements extend acquisition and confirm that the detection limit improves as 1/√t, and monitor long-term sensitivity drift with the Ag 3d count rate.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Quantification, detection limits and noise\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。","用已知化學計量的標準（如熱氧化 SiO₂、PET 的 C/O = 10/4）定量，結果應在 ±10% 相對誤差內。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate.","Quantify standards of known stoichiometry, such as thermal SiO₂ or PET with C/O = 10/4, expecting agreement within ±10% relative."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用已知化學計量的標準（如熱氧化 SiO₂、PET 的 C/O = 10/4）定量，結果應在 ±10% 相對誤差內；比較 Shirley 與 Tougaard 背景對面積的影響並記錄；對微量元素延長取樣時間，確認偵測極限按 1/√t 改善，並用 Ag 3d 計數率監控儀器靈敏度的長期漂移。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Quantify standards of known stoichiometry, such as thermal SiO₂ or PET with C/O = 10/4, expecting agreement within ±10% relative; compare the effect of Shirley versus Tougaard backgrounds on areas and record it; for trace elements extend acquisition and confirm that the detection limit improves as 1/√t, and monitor long-term sensitivity drift with the Ag 3d count rate. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a447-v12-24","title":"定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊：失效診斷","titleEn":"Quantification, detection limits and noise: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「相對靈敏度因子與背景扣除」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Relative sensitivity factors and background subtraction” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"忽略傳輸函數隨動能的變化，用另一台儀器的靈敏度因子做定量，高動能元素被系統性低估 20% 以上；對含碳污染層的樣品直接定量，則所有基材元素被稀釋，報告出的化學計量與真實材料不符。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Ignoring the kinetic-energy dependence of the transmission function and quantifying with another instrument's sensitivity factors underestimates high-kinetic-energy elements by more than 20%; quantifying a carbon-contaminated sample as measured dilutes every substrate element so the reported stoichiometry does not match the real material. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：偵測極限由背景的 Poisson 統計決定，典型為 0.1 到 1 原子百分比，與元素截面、譜線重疊及取樣時間有關；均勻性假設不成立時，定量只代表資訊深度內的加權平均。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The detection limit is set by Poisson statistics of the background, typically 0.1 to 1 atomic percent depending on cross-section, line overlap and acquisition time; when the homogeneity assumption fails, the result is only a weighted average over the information depth.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"忽略傳輸函數隨動能的變化，用另一台儀器的靈敏度因子做定量，高動能元素被系統性低估 20% 以上；對含碳污染層的樣品直接定量，則所有基材元素被稀釋，報告出的化學計量與真實材料不符。","textEn":"Ignoring the kinetic-energy dependence of the transmission function and quantifying with another instrument's sensitivity factors underestimates high-kinetic-energy elements by more than 20%; quantifying a carbon-contaminated sample as measured dilutes every substrate element so the reported stoichiometry does not match the real material.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「定量分析、偵測極限與雜訊」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Quantification, detection limits and noise\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["忽略傳輸函數隨動能的變化，用另一台儀器的靈敏度因子做定量，高動能元素被系統性低估 20% 以上。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Ignoring the kinetic-energy dependence of the transmission function and quantifying with another instrument's sensitivity factors underestimates high-kinetic-energy elements by more than 20%.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"忽略傳輸函數隨動能的變化，用另一台儀器的靈敏度因子做定量，高動能元素被系統性低估 20% 以上；對含碳污染層的樣品直接定量，則所有基材元素被稀釋，報告出的化學計量與真實材料不符。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ignoring the kinetic-energy dependence of the transmission function and quantifying with another instrument's sensitivity factors underestimates high-kinetic-energy elements by more than 20%; quantifying a carbon-contaminated sample as measured dilutes every substrate element so the reported stoichiometry does not match the real material. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a447-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析」與「儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling\" and \"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a447-v12-25","title":"超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「UHV 分析腔與離子槍」如何決定X 光光電子能譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “UHV analysis chamber and ion gun” determines the key performance of “X-ray photoelectron spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"XPS 只看最表面幾奈米，所以分析腔必須在 10⁻⁹ mbar 以下，否則殘氣在一次長時間取樣內就會在表面累積碳與氧；樣品經傳送腔進入，表面清潔用低能 Ar⁺ 濺射。深度剖析交替進行濺射與取譜，用單原子 Ar⁺ 可剖析無機層，氣體團簇離子（Ar₁₀₀₀⁺ 等）可剖析有機層而不破壞化學態；濺射速率由束流密度、濺射產率與材料原子密度決定。整合時要安排 X 光斑、分析器視野與離子濺射坑的同心與尺寸關係，否則剖析深度解析度被坑壁效應破壞。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「UHV 分析腔與離子槍」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Because XPS sees only the top few nanometres, the analysis chamber must stay below 10⁻⁹ mbar or residual gas deposits carbon and oxygen within one long acquisition; samples enter through a load lock and surfaces are cleaned by low-energy Ar⁺ sputtering. Depth profiling alternates sputtering and spectra, using monatomic Ar⁺ for inorganic layers and gas-cluster ions such as Ar₁₀₀₀⁺ for organic layers without destroying chemical states; the sputter rate is set by current density, sputter yield and the material's atomic density. Integration must keep the X-ray spot, analyser field of view and sputter crater concentric and correctly sized, or crater-wall effects ruin the depth resolution. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “UHV analysis chamber and ion gun”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：單分子層時間：在 10⁻⁹ mbar、黏附係數 1 時約 1 000 s，黏附係數 0.1 時約 2.8 h，所以 30 分鐘的高解析譜在 10⁻⁹ mbar 下可累積約 0.1 單層碳。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Monolayer time: about 1 000 s at 10⁻⁹ mbar with sticking coefficient 1, about 2.8 h with 0.1, so a 30-minute high-resolution spectrum at 10⁻⁹ mbar accumulates roughly 0.1 monolayer of carbon.","failure":"常見誤解：「真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「UHV 分析腔與離子槍」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “UHV analysis chamber and ion gun”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-25-k1","title":"超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析","titleEn":"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling","text":"XPS 只看最表面幾奈米，所以分析腔必須在 10⁻⁹ mbar 以下，否則殘氣在一次長時間取樣內就會在表面累積碳與氧；樣品經傳送腔進入，表面清潔用低能 Ar⁺ 濺射。深度剖析交替進行濺射與取譜，用單原子 Ar⁺ 可剖析無機層，氣體團簇離子（Ar₁₀₀₀⁺ 等）可剖析有機層而不破壞化學態；濺射速率由束流密度、濺射產率與材料原子密度決定。","textEn":"Because XPS sees only the top few nanometres, the analysis chamber must stay below 10⁻⁹ mbar or residual gas deposits carbon and oxygen within one long acquisition; samples enter through a load lock and surfaces are cleaned by low-energy Ar⁺ sputtering. Depth profiling alternates sputtering and spectra, using monatomic Ar⁺ for inorganic layers and gas-cluster ions such as Ar₁₀₀₀⁺ for organic layers without destroying chemical states; the sputter rate is set by current density, sputter yield and the material's atomic density.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling\" is correct?","options":["真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。","XPS 只看最表面幾奈米，所以分析腔必須在 10⁻⁹ mbar 以下，否則殘氣在一次長時間取樣內就會在表面累積碳與氧。","安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。"],"optionsEn":["Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality.","Because XPS sees only the top few nanometres, the analysis chamber must stay below 10⁻⁹ mbar or residual gas deposits carbon and oxygen within one long acquisition.","An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on."],"answer":1,"explanation":"XPS 只看最表面幾奈米，所以分析腔必須在 10⁻⁹ mbar 以下，否則殘氣在一次長時間取樣內就會在表面累積碳與氧；樣品經傳送腔進入，表面清潔用低能 Ar⁺ 濺射。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Because XPS sees only the top few nanometres, the analysis chamber must stay below 10⁻⁹ mbar or residual gas deposits carbon and oxygen within one long acquisition; samples enter through a load lock and surfaces are cleaned by low-energy Ar⁺ sputtering. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a447-v12-26","title":"超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析：定量估算","titleEn":"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「UHV 分析腔與離子槍」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “UHV analysis chamber and ion gun” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：單分子層時間：在 10⁻⁹ mbar、黏附係數 1 時約 1 000 s，黏附係數 0.1 時約 2.8 h，所以 30 分鐘的高解析譜在 10⁻⁹ mbar 下可累積約 0.1 單層碳。濺射速率：Ar⁺ 1 keV、束流 1 µA 掃描 2 mm×2 mm 面積，電流密度 25 µA/cm² 即 1.56×10¹⁴ ions/(cm²·s)；SiO₂ 的濺射產率取 1 atom/ion、原子密度 6.6×10²² cm⁻³，速率 ≈ 1.56×10¹⁴/6.6×10²² = 2.4×10⁻⁹ cm/s ≈ 1.4 nm/min；100 nm 的氧化層需約 70 分鐘。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Monolayer time: about 1 000 s at 10⁻⁹ mbar with sticking coefficient 1, about 2.8 h with 0.1, so a 30-minute high-resolution spectrum at 10⁻⁹ mbar accumulates roughly 0.1 monolayer of carbon. Sputter rate: 1 keV Ar⁺ at 1 µA rastered over 2 mm×2 mm is 25 µA/cm² or 1.56×10¹⁴ ions/(cm²·s); with a SiO₂ sputter yield of 1 atom/ion and atomic density 6.6×10²² cm⁻³ the rate is ≈ 1.56×10¹⁴/6.6×10²² = 2.4×10⁻⁹ cm/s ≈ 1.4 nm/min, so a 100 nm oxide takes about 70 minutes. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以殘氣分析儀記錄分析腔的 H₂O、CO 與碳氫分壓；用已知厚度的 Ta₂O₅/Ta 參考層（30 nm 或 100 nm）做深度剖析，從達到界面的時間反推濺射速率，並以 84% 到 16% 強度落差對應的深度定義深度解析度；用輪廓儀量濺射坑深度與平整度，確認坑底平坦區大於分析面積。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Log H₂O, CO and hydrocarbon partial pressures in the analysis chamber with a residual-gas analyser; profile a Ta₂O₅/Ta reference layer of known thickness (30 nm or 100 nm), derive the sputter rate from the time to reach the interface and define the depth resolution as the depth between the 84% and 16% intensity levels; measure crater depth and flatness with a profilometer, confirming that the flat crater floor exceeds the analysed area.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"單分子層時間：在 10⁻⁹ mbar、黏附係數 1 時約 1 000 s，黏附係數 0.1 時約 2.8 h，所以 30 分鐘的高解析譜在 10⁻⁹ mbar 下可累積約 0.1 單層碳。濺射速率：Ar⁺ 1 keV、束流 1 µA 掃描 2 mm×2 mm 面積，電流密度 25 µA/cm² 即 1.56×10¹⁴ ions/(cm²·s)；SiO₂ 的濺射產率取 1 atom/ion、原子密度 6.6×10²² cm⁻³，速率 ≈ 1.56×10¹⁴/6.6×10²² = 2.4×10⁻⁹ cm/s ≈ 1.4 nm/min；100 nm 的氧化層需約 70 分鐘。","textEn":"Monolayer time: about 1 000 s at 10⁻⁹ mbar with sticking coefficient 1, about 2.8 h with 0.1, so a 30-minute high-resolution spectrum at 10⁻⁹ mbar accumulates roughly 0.1 monolayer of carbon. Sputter rate: 1 keV Ar⁺ at 1 µA rastered over 2 mm×2 mm is 25 µA/cm² or 1.56×10¹⁴ ions/(cm²·s); with a SiO₂ sputter yield of 1 atom/ion and atomic density 6.6×10²² cm⁻³ the rate is ≈ 1.56×10¹⁴/6.6×10²² = 2.4×10⁻⁹ cm/s ≈ 1.4 nm/min, so a 100 nm oxide takes about 70 minutes.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling\", which statement holds?","options":["X 光能穿透幾微米，所以 XPS 的分析深度也是幾微米。","通能越高解析度越好，因為電子能量越高越容易分開。","單分子層時間：在 10⁻⁹ mbar、黏附係數 1 時約 1 000 s，黏附係數 0.1 時約 2.8 h，所以 30 分鐘的高解析譜在 10⁻⁹ mbar 下可累積約 0.1 單層碳。"],"optionsEn":["X-rays penetrate micrometres, so the XPS analysis depth is also micrometres.","Higher pass energy gives better resolution because faster electrons are easier to separate.","Monolayer time: about 1 000 s at 10⁻⁹ mbar with sticking coefficient 1, about 2.8 h with 0.1, so a 30-minute high-resolution spectrum at 10⁻⁹ mbar accumulates roughly 0.1 monolayer of carbon."],"answer":2,"explanation":"單分子層時間：在 10⁻⁹ mbar、黏附係數 1 時約 1 000 s，黏附係數 0.1 時約 2.8 h，所以 30 分鐘的高解析譜在 10⁻⁹ mbar 下可累積約 0.1 單層碳。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Monolayer time: about 1 000 s at 10⁻⁹ mbar with sticking coefficient 1, about 2.8 h with 0.1, so a 30-minute high-resolution spectrum at 10⁻⁹ mbar accumulates roughly 0.1 monolayer of carbon. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a447-v12-27","title":"超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「UHV 分析腔與離子槍」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “UHV analysis chamber and ion gun” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以殘氣分析儀記錄分析腔的 H₂O、CO 與碳氫分壓；用已知厚度的 Ta₂O₅/Ta 參考層（30 nm 或 100 nm）做深度剖析，從達到界面的時間反推濺射速率，並以 84% 到 16% 強度落差對應的深度定義深度解析度；用輪廓儀量濺射坑深度與平整度，確認坑底平坦區大於分析面積。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Log H₂O, CO and hydrocarbon partial pressures in the analysis chamber with a residual-gas analyser; profile a Ta₂O₅/Ta reference layer of known thickness (30 nm or 100 nm), derive the sputter rate from the time to reach the interface and define the depth resolution as the depth between the 84% and 16% intensity levels; measure crater depth and flatness with a profilometer, confirming that the flat crater floor exceeds the analysed area. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：濺射坑與分析區沒有同心，坑壁未被完全剖析的材料持續貢獻訊號，深度剖析中薄層的界面被拖長、彷彿層間互擴散；單原子 Ar⁺ 剖析聚合物時化學鍵被打斷，C 1s 的 C=O 成分消失，被誤判為材料本身沒有這種鍵結。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A sputter crater not concentric with the analysed area leaves crater walls contributing un-profiled material, so interfaces smear as if the layers had interdiffused; monatomic Ar⁺ profiling of a polymer breaks bonds and the C=O component of C 1s vanishes, misread as absence of that bond in the material.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以殘氣分析儀記錄分析腔的 H₂O、CO 與碳氫分壓；用已知厚度的 Ta₂O₅/Ta 參考層（30 nm 或 100 nm）做深度剖析，從達到界面的時間反推濺射速率，並以 84% 到 16% 強度落差對應的深度定義深度解析度；用輪廓儀量濺射坑深度與平整度，確認坑底平坦區大於分析面積。","textEn":"Log H₂O, CO and hydrocarbon partial pressures in the analysis chamber with a residual-gas analyser; profile a Ta₂O₅/Ta reference layer of known thickness (30 nm or 100 nm), derive the sputter rate from the time to reach the interface and define the depth resolution as the depth between the 84% and 16% intensity levels; measure crater depth and flatness with a profilometer, confirming that the flat crater floor exceeds the analysed area.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling\"?","options":["以殘氣分析儀記錄分析腔的 H₂O、CO 與碳氫分壓。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。"],"optionsEn":["Log H₂O, CO and hydrocarbon partial pressures in the analysis chamber with a residual-gas analyser.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以殘氣分析儀記錄分析腔的 H₂O、CO 與碳氫分壓；用已知厚度的 Ta₂O₅/Ta 參考層（30 nm 或 100 nm）做深度剖析，從達到界面的時間反推濺射速率，並以 84% 到 16% 強度落差對應的深度定義深度解析度；用輪廓儀量濺射坑深度與平整度，確認坑底平坦區大於分析面積。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Log H₂O, CO and hydrocarbon partial pressures in the analysis chamber with a residual-gas analyser; profile a Ta₂O₅/Ta reference layer of known thickness (30 nm or 100 nm), derive the sputter rate from the time to reach the interface and define the depth resolution as the depth between the 84% and 16% intensity levels; measure crater depth and flatness with a profilometer, confirming that the flat crater floor exceeds the analysed area. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a447-v12-28","title":"超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析：失效診斷","titleEn":"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「UHV 分析腔與離子槍」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “UHV analysis chamber and ion gun” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"濺射坑與分析區沒有同心，坑壁未被完全剖析的材料持續貢獻訊號，深度剖析中薄層的界面被拖長、彷彿層間互擴散；單原子 Ar⁺ 剖析聚合物時化學鍵被打斷，C 1s 的 C=O 成分消失，被誤判為材料本身沒有這種鍵結。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A sputter crater not concentric with the analysed area leaves crater walls contributing un-profiled material, so interfaces smear as if the layers had interdiffused; monatomic Ar⁺ profiling of a polymer breaks bonds and the C=O component of C 1s vanishes, misread as absence of that bond in the material. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：整合時要安排 X 光斑、分析器視野與離子濺射坑的同心與尺寸關係，否則剖析深度解析度被坑壁效應破壞。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Integration must keep the X-ray spot, analyser field of view and sputter crater concentric and correctly sized, or crater-wall effects ruin the depth resolution.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「真空只要能讓 X 光源正常運作就夠了，對譜圖品質沒有影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Vacuum only needs to keep the X-ray source running and does not affect spectrum quality.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"濺射坑與分析區沒有同心，坑壁未被完全剖析的材料持續貢獻訊號，深度剖析中薄層的界面被拖長、彷彿層間互擴散；單原子 Ar⁺ 剖析聚合物時化學鍵被打斷，C 1s 的 C=O 成分消失，被誤判為材料本身沒有這種鍵結。","textEn":"A sputter crater not concentric with the analysed area leaves crater walls contributing un-profiled material, so interfaces smear as if the layers had interdiffused; monatomic Ar⁺ profiling of a polymer breaks bonds and the C=O component of C 1s vanishes, misread as absence of that bond in the material.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「超高真空、污染控制與深度剖析」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Ultrahigh vacuum, contamination control and depth profiling\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","濺射坑與分析區沒有同心，坑壁未被完全剖析的材料持續貢獻訊號，深度剖析中薄層的界面被拖長、彷彿層間互擴散。","安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A sputter crater not concentric with the analysed area leaves crater walls contributing un-profiled material, so interfaces smear as if the layers had interdiffused.","An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on."],"answer":1,"explanation":"濺射坑與分析區沒有同心，坑壁未被完全剖析的材料持續貢獻訊號，深度剖析中薄層的界面被拖長、彷彿層間互擴散；單原子 Ar⁺ 剖析聚合物時化學鍵被打斷，C 1s 的 C=O 成分消失，被誤判為材料本身沒有這種鍵結。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A sputter crater not concentric with the analysed area leaves crater walls contributing un-profiled material, so interfaces smear as if the layers had interdiffused; monatomic Ar⁺ profiling of a polymer breaks bonds and the C=O component of C 1s vanishes, misread as absence of that bond in the material. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a447-v12-29","title":"儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「儀器驗收表與標準樣品組」如何決定X 光光電子能譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Instrument acceptance table and reference-sample set” determines the key performance of “X-ray photoelectron spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"XPS 的驗收把能量尺度、解析度、靈敏度、電荷補償、空間解析與深度剖析能力各自定義成可量化的測試：ISO 15472 三點校正、Ag 3d₅/₂ 在指定通能的峰寬與計數率、絕緣標準片的峰位與峰寬、刀口或網格的 X 光斑尺寸、Ta₂O₅ 參考層的深度解析度。交接時要留下校正時間表、每項測試的接受值與實測值、所用標準片的來源與清潔程序，以及靈敏度與能量尺度的長期趨勢圖，讓後續操作者能判斷儀器是否仍在受控狀態。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「儀器驗收表與標準樣品組」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"XPS acceptance defines energy scale, resolution, sensitivity, charge compensation, spatial resolution and depth-profiling capability as separate quantified tests: the three-point ISO 15472 calibration, Ag 3d₅/₂ width and count rate at a specified pass energy, peak position and width on insulating standards, X-ray spot size from a knife edge or grid, and depth resolution on a Ta₂O₅ reference layer. The handoff leaves a calibration schedule, acceptance and measured values for every test, the provenance and cleaning procedure of each standard, and trend charts of sensitivity and energy scale, so later operators can judge whether the instrument remains in control. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Instrument acceptance table and reference-sample set”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：驗收門檻範例：Au、Ag、Cu 三點殘差 ≤ ±0.1 eV；Ag 3d₅/₂ 在 E_p = 20 eV 的 FWHM ≤ 0.50 eV，計數率 ≥ 1×10⁶ cps（400 µm 光斑）；PET 標準片 C 1s 的 C–C 與 O–C=O 分離 4.0 ± 0.2 eV；Ta₂O₅ 30 nm 參考層的深度解析度 ≤ 3 nm（即 10%）；光斑尺寸由刀口掃描的 16% 到 84% 寬度定義，400 µm 模式實測 ≤ 450 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Example acceptance thresholds: residuals at Au, Ag and Cu within ±0.1 eV; Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM ≤ 0.50 eV at E_p = 20 eV with a count rate ≥ 1×10⁶ cps for a 400 µm spot; on a PET standard the C 1s separation between C–C and O–C=O at 4.0 ± 0.2 eV; depth resolution ≤ 3 nm (10%) on a 30 nm Ta₂O₅ reference; spot size defined by the 16% to 84% width of a knife-edge scan, measured ≤ 450 µm in 400 µm mode.","failure":"常見誤解：「安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「儀器驗收表與標準樣品組」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Instrument acceptance table and reference-sample set”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-29-k1","title":"儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff","text":"XPS 的驗收把能量尺度、解析度、靈敏度、電荷補償、空間解析與深度剖析能力各自定義成可量化的測試：ISO 15472 三點校正、Ag 3d₅/₂ 在指定通能的峰寬與計數率、絕緣標準片的峰位與峰寬、刀口或網格的 X 光斑尺寸、Ta₂O₅ 參考層的深度解析度。交接時要留下校正時間表、每項測試的接受值與實測值、所用標準片的來源與清潔程序，以及靈敏度與能量尺度的長期趨勢圖，讓後續操作者能判斷儀器是否仍在受控狀態。","textEn":"XPS acceptance defines energy scale, resolution, sensitivity, charge compensation, spatial resolution and depth-profiling capability as separate quantified tests: the three-point ISO 15472 calibration, Ag 3d₅/₂ width and count rate at a specified pass energy, peak position and width on insulating standards, X-ray spot size from a knife edge or grid, and depth resolution on a Ta₂O₅ reference layer. The handoff leaves a calibration schedule, acceptance and measured values for every test, the provenance and cleaning procedure of each standard, and trend charts of sensitivity and energy scale, so later operators can judge whether the instrument remains in control.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。","結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。","XPS 的驗收把能量尺度、解析度、靈敏度、電荷補償、空間解析與深度剖析能力各自定義成可量化的測試：ISO 15472 三點校正、Ag 3d₅/₂ 在指定通能的峰寬與計數率、絕緣標準片的峰位與峰寬、刀口或網格的 X 光斑尺寸、Ta₂O₅ 參考層的深度解析度。"],"optionsEn":["An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on.","Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment.","XPS acceptance defines energy scale, resolution, sensitivity, charge compensation, spatial resolution and depth-profiling capability as separate quantified tests: the three-point ISO 15472 calibration, Ag 3d₅/₂ width and count rate at a specified pass energy, peak position and width on insulating standards, X-ray spot size from a knife edge or grid, and depth resolution on a Ta₂O₅ reference layer."],"answer":2,"explanation":"XPS 的驗收把能量尺度、解析度、靈敏度、電荷補償、空間解析與深度剖析能力各自定義成可量化的測試：ISO 15472 三點校正、Ag 3d₅/₂ 在指定通能的峰寬與計數率、絕緣標準片的峰位與峰寬、刀口或網格的 X 光斑尺寸、Ta₂O₅ 參考層的深度解析度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"XPS acceptance defines energy scale, resolution, sensitivity, charge compensation, spatial resolution and depth-profiling capability as separate quantified tests: the three-point ISO 15472 calibration, Ag 3d₅/₂ width and count rate at a specified pass energy, peak position and width on insulating standards, X-ray spot size from a knife edge or grid, and depth resolution on a Ta₂O₅ reference layer. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a447-v12-30","title":"儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「儀器驗收表與標準樣品組」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Instrument acceptance table and reference-sample set” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：驗收門檻範例：Au、Ag、Cu 三點殘差 ≤ ±0.1 eV；Ag 3d₅/₂ 在 E_p = 20 eV 的 FWHM ≤ 0.50 eV，計數率 ≥ 1×10⁶ cps（400 µm 光斑）；PET 標準片 C 1s 的 C–C 與 O–C=O 分離 4.0 ± 0.2 eV；Ta₂O₅ 30 nm 參考層的深度解析度 ≤ 3 nm（即 10%）；光斑尺寸由刀口掃描的 16% 到 84% 寬度定義，400 µm 模式實測 ≤ 450 µm。若靈敏度趨勢在 6 個月內下降超過 30%，排程更換陽極或檢查偵測器。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Example acceptance thresholds: residuals at Au, Ag and Cu within ±0.1 eV; Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM ≤ 0.50 eV at E_p = 20 eV with a count rate ≥ 1×10⁶ cps for a 400 µm spot; on a PET standard the C 1s separation between C–C and O–C=O at 4.0 ± 0.2 eV; depth resolution ≤ 3 nm (10%) on a 30 nm Ta₂O₅ reference; spot size defined by the 16% to 84% width of a knife-edge scan, measured ≤ 450 µm in 400 µm mode. A sensitivity trend falling more than 30% within 6 months schedules anode replacement or detector inspection. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：依序執行三點校正、Ag 3d 解析度與計數率、PET 電荷補償、刀口光斑、Ta₂O₅ 深度剖析五項測試，各重複三次取平均與標準差；把結果與上次驗收及廠商規格並列，任何項目超出門檻先排除樣品與清潔因素，再追查單色器、透鏡與偵測器，修復後整組重測。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Run the five tests in order, three-point calibration, Ag 3d resolution and count rate, PET charge compensation, knife-edge spot size and Ta₂O₅ depth profile, each three times with mean and standard deviation; set the results beside the previous acceptance and the vendor specification, and for any item outside threshold first exclude sample and cleaning causes, then trace the monochromator, lens and detector, repeating the whole set after repair.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"驗收門檻範例：Au、Ag、Cu 三點殘差 ≤ ±0.1 eV；Ag 3d₅/₂ 在 E_p = 20 eV 的 FWHM ≤ 0.50 eV，計數率 ≥ 1×10⁶ cps（400 µm 光斑）；PET 標準片 C 1s 的 C–C 與 O–C=O 分離 4.0 ± 0.2 eV；Ta₂O₅ 30 nm 參考層的深度解析度 ≤ 3 nm（即 10%）；光斑尺寸由刀口掃描的 16% 到 84% 寬度定義，400 µm 模式實測 ≤ 450 µm。若靈敏度趨勢在 6 個月內下降超過 30%，排程更換陽極或檢查偵測器。","textEn":"Example acceptance thresholds: residuals at Au, Ag and Cu within ±0.1 eV; Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM ≤ 0.50 eV at E_p = 20 eV with a count rate ≥ 1×10⁶ cps for a 400 µm spot; on a PET standard the C 1s separation between C–C and O–C=O at 4.0 ± 0.2 eV; depth resolution ≤ 3 nm (10%) on a 30 nm Ta₂O₅ reference; spot size defined by the 16% to 84% width of a knife-edge scan, measured ≤ 450 µm in 400 µm mode. A sensitivity trend falling more than 30% within 6 months schedules anode replacement or detector inspection.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["驗收門檻範例：Au、Ag、Cu 三點殘差 ≤ ±0.1 eV。","單色器只是減少背景，對能量解析度沒有幫助。","只要用 C 1s = 284.8 eV 校正，任何樣品的結合能都能準到 0.1 eV。"],"optionsEn":["Example acceptance thresholds: residuals at Au, Ag and Cu within ±0.1 eV.","A monochromator only reduces background and does nothing for energy resolution.","Referencing C 1s to 284.8 eV makes binding energies accurate to 0.1 eV on any sample."],"answer":0,"explanation":"驗收門檻範例：Au、Ag、Cu 三點殘差 ≤ ±0.1 eV；Ag 3d₅/₂ 在 E_p = 20 eV 的 FWHM ≤ 0.50 eV，計數率 ≥ 1×10⁶ cps（400 µm 光斑）；PET 標準片 C 1s 的 C–C 與 O–C=O 分離 4.0 ± 0.2 eV；Ta₂O₅ 30 nm 參考層的深度解析度 ≤ 3 nm（即 10%）；光斑尺寸由刀口掃描的 16% 到 84% 寬度定義，400 µm 模式實測 ≤ 450 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Example acceptance thresholds: residuals at Au, Ag and Cu within ±0.1 eV; Ag 3d₅/₂ FWHM ≤ 0.50 eV at E_p = 20 eV with a count rate ≥ 1×10⁶ cps for a 400 µm spot; on a PET standard the C 1s separation between C–C and O–C=O at 4.0 ± 0.2 eV; depth resolution ≤ 3 nm (10%) on a 30 nm Ta₂O₅ reference; spot size defined by the 16% to 84% width of a knife-edge scan, measured ≤ 450 µm in 400 µm mode. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a447-v12-31","title":"儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「儀器驗收表與標準樣品組」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Instrument acceptance table and reference-sample set” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"依序執行三點校正、Ag 3d 解析度與計數率、PET 電荷補償、刀口光斑、Ta₂O₅ 深度剖析五項測試，各重複三次取平均與標準差；把結果與上次驗收及廠商規格並列，任何項目超出門檻先排除樣品與清潔因素，再追查單色器、透鏡與偵測器，修復後整組重測。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Run the five tests in order, three-point calibration, Ag 3d resolution and count rate, PET charge compensation, knife-edge spot size and Ta₂O₅ depth profile, each three times with mean and standard deviation; set the results beside the previous acceptance and the vendor specification, and for any item outside threshold first exclude sample and cleaning causes, then trace the monochromator, lens and detector, repeating the whole set after repair. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只在安裝時驗收而無長期趨勢，陽極老化讓計數率一年內掉到三分之一，微量元素偵測極限悄悄從 0.1 at% 退到 0.3 at%，使用者卻以為樣品真的更乾淨；交接紀錄缺少標準片清潔程序，新操作者用氧化的銀片校正，解析度與靈敏度兩項全部誤判。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Accepting only at installation without trend data lets anode ageing cut the count rate to a third within a year, quietly degrading the trace detection limit from 0.1 at% to 0.3 at% while users believe their samples are cleaner; a handoff lacking the standard-cleaning procedure makes a new operator calibrate on oxidised silver and misjudge both resolution and sensitivity.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依序執行三點校正、Ag 3d 解析度與計數率、PET 電荷補償、刀口光斑、Ta₂O₅ 深度剖析五項測試，各重複三次取平均與標準差；把結果與上次驗收及廠商規格並列，任何項目超出門檻先排除樣品與清潔因素，再追查單色器、透鏡與偵測器，修復後整組重測。","textEn":"Run the five tests in order, three-point calibration, Ag 3d resolution and count rate, PET charge compensation, knife-edge spot size and Ta₂O₅ depth profile, each three times with mean and standard deviation; set the results beside the previous acceptance and the vendor specification, and for any item outside threshold first exclude sample and cleaning causes, then trace the monochromator, lens and detector, repeating the whole set after repair.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","依序執行三點校正、Ag 3d 解析度與計數率、PET 電荷補償、刀口光斑、Ta₂O₅ 深度剖析五項測試，各重複三次取平均與標準差。","譜圖上的峰高比就直接等於原子比。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Run the five tests in order, three-point calibration, Ag 3d resolution and count rate, PET charge compensation, knife-edge spot size and Ta₂O₅ depth profile, each three times with mean and standard deviation.","The ratio of peak heights in the spectrum directly equals the atomic ratio."],"answer":1,"explanation":"依序執行三點校正、Ag 3d 解析度與計數率、PET 電荷補償、刀口光斑、Ta₂O₅ 深度剖析五項測試，各重複三次取平均與標準差；把結果與上次驗收及廠商規格並列，任何項目超出門檻先排除樣品與清潔因素，再追查單色器、透鏡與偵測器，修復後整組重測。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Run the five tests in order, three-point calibration, Ag 3d resolution and count rate, PET charge compensation, knife-edge spot size and Ta₂O₅ depth profile, each three times with mean and standard deviation; set the results beside the previous acceptance and the vendor specification, and for any item outside threshold first exclude sample and cleaning causes, then trace the monochromator, lens and detector, repeating the whole set after repair. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a447-v12-32","title":"儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"prerequisiteIds":["a447-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「儀器驗收表與標準樣品組」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Instrument acceptance table and reference-sample set” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只在安裝時驗收而無長期趨勢，陽極老化讓計數率一年內掉到三分之一，微量元素偵測極限悄悄從 0.1 at% 退到 0.3 at%，使用者卻以為樣品真的更乾淨；交接紀錄缺少標準片清潔程序，新操作者用氧化的銀片校正，解析度與靈敏度兩項全部誤判。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Accepting only at installation without trend data lets anode ageing cut the count rate to a third within a year, quietly degrading the trace detection limit from 0.1 at% to 0.3 at% while users believe their samples are cleaner; a handoff lacking the standard-cleaning procedure makes a new operator calibrate on oxidised silver and misjudge both resolution and sensitivity. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接時要留下校正時間表、每項測試的接受值與實測值、所用標準片的來源與清潔程序，以及靈敏度與能量尺度的長期趨勢圖，讓後續操作者能判斷儀器是否仍在受控狀態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff leaves a calibration schedule, acceptance and measured values for every test, the provenance and cleaning procedure of each standard, and trend charts of sensitivity and energy scale, so later operators can judge whether the instrument remains in control.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「安裝時通過驗收的儀器，之後的數據自動可信。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An instrument that passed acceptance at installation produces trustworthy data from then on.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a447-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只在安裝時驗收而無長期趨勢，陽極老化讓計數率一年內掉到三分之一，微量元素偵測極限悄悄從 0.1 at% 退到 0.3 at%，使用者卻以為樣品真的更乾淨；交接紀錄缺少標準片清潔程序，新操作者用氧化的銀片校正，解析度與靈敏度兩項全部誤判。","textEn":"Accepting only at installation without trend data lets anode ageing cut the count rate to a third within a year, quietly degrading the trace detection limit from 0.1 at% to 0.3 at% while users believe their samples are cleaner; a handoff lacking the standard-cleaning procedure makes a new operator calibrate on oxidised silver and misjudge both resolution and sensitivity.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]},{"id":"a447-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「儀器驗收、長期監控與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Instrument acceptance, long-term monitoring and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","結合能是元素的固定常數，不會因為化學環境而改變。","只在安裝時驗收而無長期趨勢，陽極老化讓計數率一年內掉到三分之一，微量元素偵測極限悄悄從 0.1 at% 退到 0.3 at%，使用者卻以為樣品真的更乾淨。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Binding energy is a fixed constant of an element and never changes with chemical environment.","Accepting only at installation without trend data lets anode ageing cut the count rate to a third within a year, quietly degrading the trace detection limit from 0.1 at% to 0.3 at% while users believe their samples are cleaner."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只在安裝時驗收而無長期趨勢，陽極老化讓計數率一年內掉到三分之一，微量元素偵測極限悄悄從 0.1 at% 退到 0.3 at%，使用者卻以為樣品真的更乾淨；交接紀錄缺少標準片清潔程序，新操作者用氧化的銀片校正，解析度與靈敏度兩項全部誤判。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Accepting only at installation without trend data lets anode ageing cut the count rate to a third within a year, quietly degrading the trace detection limit from 0.1 at% to 0.3 at% while users believe their samples are cleaner; a handoff lacking the standard-cleaning procedure makes a new operator calibrate on oxidised silver and misjudge both resolution and sensitivity. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-thermofisher-xps-technology","v12o-nist-xps-database","v12o-nist-srd71-imfp","v12o-shimadzu-kratos-axis-supra"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
